INSERT INTO `assessment_content` VALUES ('backend','Backend Developer Technical Assessment','[{\"id\": \"q_be_1\", \"label\": \"What is the role of a backend developer in a web or mobile application?\"}, {\"id\": \"q_be_2\", \"label\": \"What is an API and why is it important for communication between frontend and backend systems?\"}, {\"id\": \"q_be_3\", \"label\": \"Explain the difference between REST API and GraphQL.\"}, {\"id\": \"q_be_4\", \"label\": \"What is the difference between SQL and NoSQL databases?\"}, {\"id\": \"q_be_5\", \"label\": \"What is authentication and authorization and why are they important in backend systems?\"}, {\"id\": \"q_be_6\", \"label\": \"What is database indexing and how does it improve performance?\"}, {\"id\": \"q_be_7\", \"label\": \"Explain the difference between synchronous and asynchronous operations in backend development.\"}, {\"id\": \"q_be_8\", \"label\": \"What are some common techniques to secure a backend API?\"}, {\"id\": \"q_be_9\", \"label\": \"What is caching and how can it improve application performance?\"}, {\"id\": \"q_be_10\", \"label\": \"Describe how you would debug a backend service if users report that the API is returning errors.\"}]','Create a simple Talent Management Backend System. The system should allow users to submit their profile information including full name, email, primary skill, years of experience, and a short description about themselves. The backend should store this information in a database and provide API endpoints to create, update, delete, and retrieve talent profiles. In addition, implement a simple admin login/authentication mechanism so that only authorized users can manage the talent records. The project should also include input validation, proper error handling, and clear API structure.','Submit the source code and include instructions on how to run the project.',1,'2026-04-18 07:02:35','2026-04-18 07:02:35'),('content-writer','Content Writer Technical Assessment','[{\"id\": \"q_cw_1\", \"label\": \"Describe the types of content you are most comfortable writing (for example blogs, articles, website content, marketing copy, newsletters, social media posts, etc.).\"}, {\"id\": \"q_cw_2\", \"label\": \"Describe your experience writing about blockchain, fintech, or Web3 topics. If you have written in this area before, explain what kind of content you created and for which audience.\"}, {\"id\": \"q_cw_3\", \"label\": \"Explain whether you have created social media visuals to support your written content and describe the tools or platforms you used.\"}, {\"id\": \"q_cw_4\", \"label\": \"How do you research a topic before writing an article or blog post?\"}, {\"id\": \"q_cw_5\", \"label\": \"What steps do you take to make your content engaging and easy for readers to understand?\"}, {\"id\": \"q_cw_6\", \"label\": \"Explain how you optimize written content for SEO.\"}, {\"id\": \"q_cw_7\", \"label\": \"How do you adapt your writing style for different audiences such as technical users, general readers, or business professionals?\"}, {\"id\": \"q_cw_8\", \"label\": \"Describe your experience writing content for websites or digital platforms.\"}, {\"id\": \"q_cw_9\", \"label\": \"How do you measure whether your content is successful or effective?\"}, {\"id\": \"q_cw_10\", \"label\": \"Describe a challenging content project you worked on and how you handled it.\"}]','Write a short article (500700 words) explaining a modern technology topic such as blockchain, AI, fintech, or digital platforms to a general audience. The article should be clear, engaging, and easy to understand. Include a suitable title and structure the content with headings or sections.','Submit your written answers along with the article in a clear document format.',1,'2026-04-18 07:11:55','2026-04-18 07:11:55'),('digital-marketing','Digital Marketing Specialist Technical Assessment','[{\"id\": \"q_dm_1\", \"label\": \"Describe the types of digital marketing work you are most experienced in, such as social media marketing, paid ads, content marketing, email marketing, SEO, or campaign management.\"}, {\"id\": \"q_dm_2\", \"label\": \"Explain how you plan a digital marketing campaign from idea to execution.\"}, {\"id\": \"q_dm_3\", \"label\": \"Describe your experience managing social media platforms for a brand or business.\"}, {\"id\": \"q_dm_4\", \"label\": \"What key metrics do you usually use to measure the success of a digital marketing campaign?\"}, {\"id\": \"q_dm_5\", \"label\": \"Explain your experience with paid advertising platforms such as Meta Ads, Google Ads, LinkedIn Ads, or similar tools.\"}, {\"id\": \"q_dm_6\", \"label\": \"How do you identify and define the right target audience for a campaign?\"}, {\"id\": \"q_dm_7\", \"label\": \"Describe how you would improve engagement and conversions for a business with low online visibility.\"}, {\"id\": \"q_dm_8\", \"label\": \"What tools have you used for analytics, campaign tracking, scheduling, or reporting?\"}, {\"id\": \"q_dm_9\", \"label\": \"Describe a digital marketing campaign you worked on and explain the results.\"}, {\"id\": \"q_dm_10\", \"label\": \"How do you adjust your digital marketing strategy when a campaign is not performing well?\"}]','Prepare a simple digital marketing plan for a business, product, or service of your choice. The plan should include the target audience, main marketing channels, content ideas, campaign objective, and a short explanation of how you would measure success. You may also include sample post ideas or ad concepts if relevant.','Submit your written answers along with the practical task in a clear document format.',1,'2026-04-18 07:13:37','2026-04-18 07:13:37'),('front-end','Frontend Developer Technical Assessment','[{\"id\": \"q_fe_1\", \"label\": \"What is the difference between HTML, CSS, and JavaScript? Explain the role of each in building a website.\"}, {\"id\": \"q_fe_2\", \"label\": \"What is responsive design and why is it important when building modern websites?\"}, {\"id\": \"q_fe_3\", \"label\": \"Explain the difference between client-side rendering and server-side rendering.\"}, {\"id\": \"q_fe_4\", \"label\": \"What is the purpose of JavaScript frameworks such as React or Vue in frontend development?\"}, {\"id\": \"q_fe_5\", \"label\": \"What is a component in modern frontend frameworks?\"}, {\"id\": \"q_fe_6\", \"label\": \"What is the difference between local storage and cookies in a browser?\"}, {\"id\": \"q_fe_7\", \"label\": \"What is an API and how does a frontend application communicate with a backend service?\"}, {\"id\": \"q_fe_8\", \"label\": \"Explain the concept of state management in frontend applications.\"}, {\"id\": \"q_fe_9\", \"label\": \"What are some techniques to improve website performance on the frontend?\"}, {\"id\": \"q_fe_10\", \"label\": \"Describe how you would debug a UI issue where a button is not responding when clicked.\"}]','Create a simple Talent Profile Page using any frontend technology such as HTML, CSS, JavaScript, React, or similar frameworks. The page should allow a user to enter basic information including full name, email, primary skill, years of experience, and a short description about themselves. After submitting the form, the page should display the entered information in a clean profile-style layout on the same page or in a separate section.','Submit the source code and include instructions on how to run the project.',1,'2026-04-18 06:56:26','2026-04-18 06:56:26'),('full-stack','Full Stack Developer Technical Assessment','[{\"id\": \"q_fs_1\", \"label\": \"What is the difference between frontend and backend development, and how do they work together in a web application?\"}, {\"id\": \"q_fs_2\", \"label\": \"What is an API and how does the frontend communicate with the backend through it?\"}, {\"id\": \"q_fs_3\", \"label\": \"Explain the difference between SQL and NoSQL databases.\"}, {\"id\": \"q_fs_4\", \"label\": \"What is the role of authentication and authorization in a web application?\"}, {\"id\": \"q_fs_5\", \"label\": \"What is the purpose of Git and version control in software development?\"}, {\"id\": \"q_fs_6\", \"label\": \"Explain what responsive design means and why it is important.\"}, {\"id\": \"q_fs_7\", \"label\": \"What are REST APIs and why are they commonly used in modern applications?\"}, {\"id\": \"q_fs_8\", \"label\": \"What is state management in frontend applications?\"}, {\"id\": \"q_fs_9\", \"label\": \"What are some techniques to improve application performance in both frontend and backend?\"}, {\"id\": \"q_fs_10\", \"label\": \"Describe how you would debug an application if users report that a feature is not working.\"}]','Create a simple Talent Management System with both frontend and backend. The application should include a frontend where users can submit their profile information such as full name, email, primary skill, years of experience, and a short description about themselves. The backend should store this information in a database and provide the required API endpoints. The system should also include a page to list submitted talents, and a simple admin login so that only authorized users can manage, update, or delete talent records. The project should demonstrate the connection between frontend, backend, and database, along with basic validation, error handling, and clean project structure.','Submit the source code and include instructions on how to run the project.',1,'2026-04-18 07:04:16','2026-04-18 07:04:16'),('graphics','Graphics Designer Technical Assessment','[{\"id\": \"q_gd_1\", \"label\": \"Describe the types of design work you are most comfortable creating, such as social media posts, branding materials, flyers, brochures, website banners, presentations, or other visual content.\"}, {\"id\": \"q_gd_2\", \"label\": \"What design tools do you mainly use, and why do you prefer them?\"}, {\"id\": \"q_gd_3\", \"label\": \"How do you make sure your design matches a brands identity and style?\"}, {\"id\": \"q_gd_4\", \"label\": \"Explain how you choose colors, fonts, and layout when creating a design.\"}, {\"id\": \"q_gd_5\", \"label\": \"How do you balance creativity and clarity when designing marketing or business materials?\"}, {\"id\": \"q_gd_6\", \"label\": \"Describe your experience creating social media visuals for businesses or campaigns.\"}, {\"id\": \"q_gd_7\", \"label\": \"What steps do you take when a client says they do not like your first design concept?\"}, {\"id\": \"q_gd_8\", \"label\": \"How do you prepare your design files for web use and for print use?\"}, {\"id\": \"q_gd_9\", \"label\": \"Describe a design project you worked on that you are proud of and explain why.\"}, {\"id\": \"q_gd_10\", \"label\": \"How do you make sure your designs communicate the message clearly to the target audience?\"}]','Create a simple visual design set for a business, product, or service of your choice. The task should include one social media post design and one promotional banner or flyer. The goal is to evaluate your design style, layout skills, branding sense, and ability to communicate a message clearly through visuals.','Submit your written answers along with the design files or exported images in a clear format.',1,'2026-04-18 07:15:58','2026-04-18 07:15:58'),('mobile','Mobile App Developer Technical Assessment','[{\"id\": \"q_mob_1\", \"label\": \"What is the difference between native mobile development and cross-platform development?\"}, {\"id\": \"q_mob_2\", \"label\": \"What are the main components of a mobile application architecture?\"}, {\"id\": \"q_mob_3\", \"label\": \"What is the role of APIs in mobile applications?\"}, {\"id\": \"q_mob_4\", \"label\": \"Explain how a mobile app typically communicates with a backend server.\"}, {\"id\": \"q_mob_5\", \"label\": \"What are some common techniques to optimize performance in a mobile application?\"}, {\"id\": \"q_mob_6\", \"label\": \"What is the importance of UI/UX design in mobile apps?\"}, {\"id\": \"q_mob_7\", \"label\": \"What are some common ways to store data locally on a mobile device?\"}, {\"id\": \"q_mob_8\", \"label\": \"Explain how push notifications work in mobile applications.\"}, {\"id\": \"q_mob_9\", \"label\": \"What are some common security practices when developing mobile apps?\"}, {\"id\": \"q_mob_10\", \"label\": \"Describe how you would debug an issue where a mobile app crashes after a user logs in.\"}]','Create a simple Talent Management Mobile App. The application should include a screen where users can enter their profile information such as full name, email, primary skill, years of experience, and a short description about themselves. The submitted information should be saved locally or connected to a backend API, and the app should include another screen to display the list of submitted talent profiles. Add a simple login screen for admin access and allow the admin to view, update, or delete talent records. The project should demonstrate clean UI structure, form handling, navigation between screens, data management, validation, and proper handling of user actions.','Submit the source code and include instructions on how to run the project.',1,'2026-04-18 07:05:43','2026-04-18 07:05:43'),('seo','SEO Specialist Technical Assessment','[{\"id\": \"q_seo_1\", \"label\": \"What is SEO and why is it important for a business website?\"}, {\"id\": \"q_seo_2\", \"label\": \"What is the difference between on-page SEO and off-page SEO?\"}, {\"id\": \"q_seo_3\", \"label\": \"What is keyword research and why is it important in SEO?\"}, {\"id\": \"q_seo_4\", \"label\": \"What are meta titles and meta descriptions, and how do they affect search results?\"}, {\"id\": \"q_seo_5\", \"label\": \"What is technical SEO and what are some common technical SEO issues?\"}, {\"id\": \"q_seo_6\", \"label\": \"Why is page speed important for SEO and user experience?\"}, {\"id\": \"q_seo_7\", \"label\": \"What is the role of backlinks in SEO?\"}, {\"id\": \"q_seo_8\", \"label\": \"How do tools like Google Search Console and Google Analytics help in SEO work?\"}, {\"id\": \"q_seo_9\", \"label\": \"What steps would you take if a website suddenly loses ranking on Google?\"}, {\"id\": \"q_seo_10\", \"label\": \"How would you measure whether an SEO strategy is successful?\"}]','Prepare a simple SEO review for a website of your choice. The task should include a short analysis of the homepage, target keywords, meta title and description suggestions, basic on-page SEO observations, and a few practical recommendations to improve search visibility. The goal is to evaluate your understanding of keyword strategy, content optimization, technical SEO basics, and your ability to give clear and useful SEO recommendations.','Submit your written answers along with the practical task in a clear document format.',1,'2026-04-18 07:08:26','2026-04-18 07:08:26'),('uix','UI/UX Designer Technical Assessment','[{\"id\": \"q_uix_1\", \"label\": \"Describe the types of UI/UX design work you are most comfortable with, such as mobile apps, websites, dashboards, landing pages, or design systems.\"}, {\"id\": \"q_uix_2\", \"label\": \"What is the difference between UI design and UX design?\"}, {\"id\": \"q_uix_3\", \"label\": \"How do you start a new design project from idea to final design?\"}, {\"id\": \"q_uix_4\", \"label\": \"Explain how you make a product easy and comfortable for users to use.\"}, {\"id\": \"q_uix_5\", \"label\": \"What tools do you use for wireframing, prototyping, and final design?\"}, {\"id\": \"q_uix_6\", \"label\": \"How do you choose colors, typography, spacing, and layout in your designs?\"}, {\"id\": \"q_uix_7\", \"label\": \"Describe your experience creating user flows, wireframes, or clickable prototypes.\"}, {\"id\": \"q_uix_8\", \"label\": \"How do you handle feedback from clients or team members when they ask for design changes?\"}, {\"id\": \"q_uix_9\", \"label\": \"Describe a UI/UX project you worked on that you are proud of and explain why.\"}, {\"id\": \"q_uix_10\", \"label\": \"How do you make sure your design is both visually attractive and easy to use?\"}]','Create a simple UI/UX design for a talent profile or talent registration page for a web or mobile platform. The design should show clear layout, user-friendly structure, and a clean visual style. Include the main screen or page and at least one additional state such as a filled form, profile view, or success message. The goal is to evaluate your layout thinking, design clarity, user experience, and overall visual presentation.','Submit your written answers along with the design file or exported screens in a clear format.',1,'2026-04-18 07:16:56','2026-04-18 07:16:56');
