-bottom:0pt;\"><span style=\"font-size: 11pt; font-family: Poppins, sans-serif; color: rgb(0, 0, 0); background-color: transparent; font-variant-numeric: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; font-variant-alternates: normal; font-variant-position: normal; font-variant-emoji: normal; vertical-align: baseline; white-space-collapse: preserve;\"><span style=\"font-family: var(--font-inter), Inter, sans-serif;\"><span style=\"font-size: 18px;\">- Peer-to-peer file sharing (Napster, BitTorrent) and others</span></span></span></p></td><td colspan=\"2\" style=\"border-width: 0.75pt; border-color: rgb(0, 0, 0); vertical-align: middle; overflow: hidden; overflow-wrap: break-word;\"><p dir=\"ltr\" style=\"line-height:1.2;margin-top:5pt;margin-bottom:5pt;\"><span style=\"font-size: 11pt; font-family: Poppins, sans-serif; color: rgb(0, 0, 0); background-color: transparent; font-variant-numeric: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; font-variant-alternates: normal; font-variant-position: normal; font-variant-emoji: normal; vertical-align: baseline; white-space-collapse: preserve;\"><span style=\"font-family: var(--font-inter), Inter, sans-serif;\"><span style=\"font-size: 18px;\">Related Technologies Web 2.0:</span></span></span></p><p dir=\"ltr\" style=\"line-height:1.2;margin-top:5pt;margin-bottom:5pt;\"><span style=\"font-size: 11pt; font-family: Poppins, sans-serif; color: rgb(0, 0, 0); background-color: transparent; font-variant-numeric: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; font-variant-alternates: normal; font-variant-position: normal; font-variant-emoji: normal; vertical-align: baseline; white-space-collapse: preserve;\"><span style=\"font-family: var(--font-inter), Inter, sans-serif;\"><span style=\"font-size: 18px;\">- Frameworks for Ajax and JavaScript</span></span></span></p><p dir=\"ltr\" style=\"line-height:1.2;margin-top:5pt;margin-bottom:5pt;\"><span style=\"font-size: 11pt; font-family: Poppins, sans-serif; color: rgb(0, 0, 0); background-color: transparent; font-variant-numeric: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; font-variant-alternates: normal; font-variant-position: normal; font-variant-emoji: normal; vertical-align: baseline; white-space-collapse: preserve;\"><span style=\"font-family: var(--font-inter), Inter, sans-serif;\"><span style=\"font-size: 18px;\">- Microsoft .NET</span></span></span></p><p dir=\"ltr\" style=\"line-height:1.2;margin-top:5pt;margin-bottom:5pt;\"><span style=\"font-size: 11pt; font-family: Poppins, sans-serif; color: rgb(0, 0, 0); background-color: transparent; font-variant-numeric: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; font-variant-alternates: normal; font-variant-position: normal; font-variant-emoji: normal; vertical-align: baseline; white-space-collapse: preserve;\"><span style=\"font-family: var(--font-inter), Inter, sans-serif;\"><span style=\"font-size: 18px;\">- Blogs</span></span></span></p><p dir=\"ltr\" style=\"line-height:1.2;margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;\"><span style=\"font-size: 11pt; font-family: Poppins, sans-serif; color: rgb(0, 0, 0); background-color: transparent; font-variant-numeric: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; font-variant-alternates: normal; font-variant-position: normal; font-variant-emoji: normal; vertical-align: baseline; white-space-collapse: preserve;\"><span style=\"font-family: var(--font-inter), Inter, sans-serif;\"><span style=\"font-size: 18px;\">- Wikis and others.</span></span></span></p></td><td style=\"border-width: 0.75pt; border-color: rgb(0, 0, 0); vertical-align: middle; overflow: hidden; overflow-wrap: break-word;\"><p dir=\"ltr\" style=\"line-height:1.2;margin-top:5pt;margin-bottom:5pt;\"><span style=\"font-size: 11pt; font-family: Poppins, sans-serif; color: rgb(0, 0, 0); background-color: transparent; font-variant-numeric: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; font-variant-alternates: normal; font-variant-position: normal; font-variant-emoji: normal; vertical-align: baseline; white-space-collapse: preserve;\"><span style=\"font-family: var(--font-inter), Inter, sans-serif;\"><span style=\"font-size: 18px;\">Associated Technologies Web 3.0:</span></span></span></p><p dir=\"ltr\" style=\"line-height:1.2;margin-top:5pt;margin-bottom:5pt;\"><span style=\"font-size: 11pt; font-family: Poppins, sans-serif; color: rgb(0, 0, 0); background-color: transparent; font-variant-numeric: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; font-variant-alternates: normal; font-variant-position: normal; font-variant-emoji: normal; vertical-align: baseline; white-space-collapse: preserve;\"><span style=\"font-family: var(--font-inter), Inter, sans-serif;\"><span style=\"font-size: 18px;\">- Semantic search</span></span></span></p><p dir=\"ltr\" style=\"line-height:1.2;margin-top:5pt;margin-bottom:5pt;\"><span style=\"font-size: 11pt; font-family: Poppins, sans-serif; color: rgb(0, 0, 0); background-color: transparent; font-variant-numeric: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; font-variant-alternates: normal; font-variant-position: normal; font-variant-emoji: normal; vertical-align: baseline; white-space-collapse: preserve;\"><span style=\"font-family: var(--font-inter), Inter, sans-serif;\"><span style=\"font-size: 18px;\">- Information databases</span></span></span></p><p dir=\"ltr\" style=\"line-height:1.2;margin-top:5pt;margin-bottom:5pt;\"><span style=\"font-size: 11pt; font-family: Poppins, sans-serif; color: rgb(0, 0, 0); background-color: transparent; font-variant-numeric: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; font-variant-alternates: normal; font-variant-position: normal; font-variant-emoji: normal; vertical-align: baseline; white-space-collapse: preserve;\"><span style=\"font-family: var(--font-inter), Inter, sans-serif;\"><span style=\"font-size: 18px;\">- Ontologies</span></span></span></p><p dir=\"ltr\" style=\"line-height:1.2;margin-top:5pt;margin-bottom:5pt;\"><span style=\"font-size: 11pt; font-family: Poppins, sans-serif; color: rgb(0, 0, 0); background-color: transparent; font-variant-numeric: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; font-variant-alternates: normal; font-variant-position: normal; font-variant-emoji: normal; vertical-align: baseline; white-space-collapse: preserve;\"><span style=\"font-family: var(--font-inter), Inter, sans-serif;\"><span style=\"font-size: 18px;\">- Intelligent digital personal</span></span></span></p><p dir=\"ltr\" style=\"line-height:1.2;margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;\"><span style=\"font-size: 11pt; font-family: Poppins, sans-serif; color: rgb(0, 0, 0); background-color: transparent; font-variant-numeric: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; font-variant-alternates: normal; font-variant-position: normal; font-variant-emoji: normal; vertical-align: baseline; white-space-collapse: preserve;\"><span style=\"font-family: var(--font-inter), Inter, sans-serif;\"><span style=\"font-size: 18px;\">- Assistants and others.</span></span></span></p></td></tr></tbody></table><br><p dir=\"ltr\" style=\"line-height:1.2;margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;\"><span style=\"font-size: 11pt; font-family: Poppins, sans-serif; color: rgb(0, 0, 0); background-color: transparent; font-weight: 700; font-variant-numeric: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; font-variant-alternates: normal; font-variant-position: normal; font-variant-emoji: normal; vertical-align: baseline; white-space-collapse: preserve;\"><span style=\"font-family: var(--font-inter), Inter, sans-serif;\"><span style=\"font-size: 18px;\">Result</span></span></span></p><p dir=\"ltr\" style=\"line-height:1.2;margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;\"><span style=\"font-size: 11pt; font-family: Poppins, sans-serif; color: rgb(0, 0, 0); background-color: transparent; font-variant-numeric: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; font-variant-alternates: normal; font-variant-position: normal; font-variant-emoji: normal; vertical-align: baseline; white-space-collapse: preserve;\"><span style=\"font-family: var(--font-inter), Inter, sans-serif;\"><span style=\"font-size: 18px;\">So, these were the main differences between Web 1.0, Web 2.0, and Web 3.0, all of which have their own uniqueness. The characteristics of Web 1.0, Web 2.0, and Web 3.0 are clearly explained in this article, as are the differences between the three. All three were used in their respective times and have revolutionized the world of the web accordingly. In the ever-evolving world of technology, there are three main generations of websites: Web 1.0, 2.0, and 3.0. Although all websites fall into one or more categories, each generation has its own strengths and weaknesses. Let\'s say you want to create a website that is supposed to be successful in the long run. In this case, it\'s important to understand which generation your target audience is using and design your website accordingly (Vegavid, n.d.).</span></span></span></p><div><span style=\"font-size: 11pt; font-family: Poppins, sans-serif; color: rgb(0, 0, 0); background-color: transparent; font-variant-numeric: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; font-variant-alternates: normal; font-variant-position: normal; font-variant-emoji: normal; vertical-align: baseline; white-space-collapse: preserve;\"><br></span>\n</div></div></div></div></span>\n</div>',1,1,70,'2025-09-12 07:18:19','2025-10-08 10:29:35'),(228,36,'Metaverse Definition','<div class=\"prose prose-lg max-w-none space-y-4\">\n\n<span id=\"docs-internal-guid-9542cc01-7fff-39e8-b144-a100bfaf8e49\"><p dir=\"ltr\" style=\"line-height:1.2;margin-top:5pt;margin-bottom:5pt;\"><span style=\"font-size: 11pt; font-family: Poppins, sans-serif; color: rgb(0, 0, 0); background-color: transparent; font-variant-numeric: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; font-variant-alternates: normal; font-variant-position: normal; font-variant-emoji: normal; vertical-align: baseline; white-space-collapse: preserve;\"><span style=\"font-size: 18px;\"><span style=\"font-family: var(--font-inter), Inter, sans-serif;\">The metaverse is described as the inevitable evolution of the internet, seamlessly connecting our digital and physical lives. The metaverse is the emerging 3-D-enabled digital space that uses virtual reality, augmented reality, and other advanced internet and semiconductor technologies to give people lifelike personal and business experiences online. (McKinsey &amp; Company, n.d.) \"We think of the metaverse as a fusion of virtual, augmented, and physical reality so that we can move in the digital world as well as in the physical world,\" says Per Ola Kristensson, Professor of Interactive Systems Engineering at Cambridge. \"These are all examples of the expansion of the reality of our world.\" (Walsh, 2023) \"I see the metaverse as a continuation of where technology was moving before COVID-19,\" John Hanke, CEO of Niantic, told us. \"We have Instagram. We have email. We have messaging. And then there are our friends in real life and the real-life activities we participate in. Sometimes there is an overlap between these two. But when I think of a real-world vision of the metaverse, it\'s really a union of these two areas, where they merge much more, where there\'s a digital extension to everything that\'s real (McKinsey &amp; Company, 2022). Recent research from McKinsey shows that about 60% of consumers welcome the transition from everyday activities such as shopping, dating, and training to the metaverse. The latest McKinsey study shows that the metaverse has the potential to generate up to $5 trillion in value by 2030. This is an opportunity that is too great to ignore. The metaverse has the potential to impact everything from employee engagement to customer experience and omnichannel sales and marketing to product innovation and community building. Examining its potential impact should be part of policy discussions. Executives should accelerate their analysis of how the metaverse could create a very different world within the next decade. It can seamlessly connect our digital and physical lives by providing a sense of immersion, real-time interactivity, user autonomy, interoperability across platforms and devices, the ability for thousands of people to interact simultaneously, and use cases that go far beyond games. However, the pace of development will depend on numerous technological and user experience factors and is not limited to a specific platform, device, or technology.</span></span></span></p><p dir=\"ltr\" style=\"line-height:1.2;margin-top:5pt;margin-bottom:5pt;\"><span style=\"font-size: 11pt; font-family: Poppins, sans-serif; color: rgb(0, 0, 0); background-color: transparent; font-variant-numeric: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; font-variant-alternates: normal; font-variant-position: normal; font-variant-emoji: normal; vertical-align: baseline; white-space-collapse: preserve;\"><span style=\"font-size: 18px;\"><span style=\"font-family: var(--font-inter), Inter, sans-serif;\">Metaverse Key Features:</span></span></span></p><p dir=\"ltr\" style=\"line-height:1.2;margin-top:5pt;margin-bottom:5pt;\"><span style=\"font-size: 11pt; font-family: Poppins, sans-serif; color: rgb(0, 0, 0); background-color: transparent; font-variant-numeric: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; font-variant-alternates: normal; font-variant-position: normal; font-variant-emoji: normal; vertical-align: baseline; white-space-collapse: preserve;\"><span style=\"font-size: 18px;\"><span style=\"font-family: var(--font-inter), Inter, sans-serif;\">Despite the many different possible definitions of the metaverse, it has several fundamental characteristics: In its most basic form, the metaverse has three characteristics:</span></span></span></p><ul style=\"padding-inline-start: 48px;\"><li dir=\"ltr\" style=\"list-style-type: disc; font-size: 9pt; font-family: Poppins, sans-serif; color: rgb(0, 0, 0); background-color: transparent; font-variant-numeric: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; font-variant-alternates: normal; font-variant-position: normal; font-variant-emoji: normal; vertical-align: baseline; white-space: pre; margin-left: 77.35pt;\" aria-level=\"1\"><p dir=\"ltr\" style=\"line-height:1.2;margin-top:5pt;margin-bottom:5pt;\" role=\"presentation\"><span style=\"font-size: 11pt; background-color: transparent; font-variant-numeric: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; font-variant-alternates: normal; font-variant-position: normal; font-variant-emoji: normal; vertical-align: baseline; text-wrap-mode: wrap;\"><span style=\"font-size: 18px;\"><span style=\"font-family: var(--font-inter), Inter, sans-serif;\">A sense of immersion</span></span></span></p></li><li dir=\"ltr\" style=\"list-style-type: disc; font-size: 9pt; font-family: Poppins, sans-serif; color: rgb(0, 0, 0); background-color: transparent; font-variant-numeric: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; font-variant-alternates: normal; font-variant-position: normal; font-variant-emoji: normal; vertical-align: baseline; white-space: pre; margin-left: 77.35pt;\" aria-level=\"1\"><p dir=\"ltr\" style=\"line-height:1.2;margin-top:5pt;margin-bottom:5pt;\" role=\"presentation\"><span style=\"font-size: 11pt; background-color: transparent; font-variant-numeric: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; font-variant-alternates: normal; font-variant-position: normal; font-variant-emoji: normal; vertical-align: baseline; text-wrap-mode: wrap;\"><span style=\"font-size: 18px;\"><span style=\"font-family: var(--font-inter), Inter, sans-serif;\">Real-time interactivity</span></span></span></p></li><li dir=\"ltr\" style=\"list-style-type: disc; font-size: 9pt; font-family: Poppins, sans-serif; color: rgb(0, 0, 0); background-color: transparent; font-variant-numeric: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; font-variant-alternates: normal; font-variant-position: normal; font-variant-emoji: normal; vertical-align: baseline; white-space: pre; margin-left: 77.35pt;\" aria-level=\"1\"><p dir=\"ltr\" style=\"line-height:1.2;margin-top:5pt;margin-bottom:5pt;\" role=\"presentation\"><span style=\"font-size: 11pt; background-color: transparent; font-variant-numeric: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; font-variant-alternates: normal; font-variant-position: normal; font-variant-emoji: normal; vertical-align: baseline; text-wrap-mode: wrap;\"><span style=\"font-size: 18px;\"><span style=\"font-family: var(--font-inter), Inter, sans-serif;\">User autonomy</span></span></span></p></li></ul><p dir=\"ltr\" style=\"line-height:1.2;margin-top:5pt;margin-bottom:5pt;\"><span style=\"font-size: 11pt; font-family: Poppins, sans-serif; color: rgb(0, 0, 0); background-color: transparent; font-variant-numeric: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; font-variant-alternates: normal; font-variant-position: normal; font-variant-emoji: normal; vertical-align: baseline; white-space-collapse: preserve;\"><span style=\"font-size: 18px;\"><span style=\"font-family: var(--font-inter), Inter, sans-serif;\">Ultimately, the full vision of the metaverse will also include:</span></span></span></p><ul style=\"padding-inline-start: 48px;\"><li dir=\"ltr\" style=\"list-style-type: disc; font-size: 9pt; font-family: Poppins, sans-serif; color: rgb(0, 0, 0); background-color: transparent; font-variant-numeric: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; font-variant-alternates: normal; font-variant-position: normal; font-variant-emoji: normal; vertical-align: baseline; white-space: pre; margin-left: 77.35pt;\" aria-level=\"1\"><p dir=\"ltr\" style=\"line-height:1.2;margin-top:5pt;margin-bottom:5pt;\" role=\"presentation\"><span style=\"font-size: 11pt; background-color: transparent; font-variant-numeric: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; font-variant-alternates: normal; font-variant-position: normal; font-variant-emoji: normal; vertical-align: baseline; text-wrap-mode: wrap;\"><span style=\"font-size: 18px;\"><span style=\"font-family: var(--font-inter), Inter, sans-serif;\">Cross-platform and cross-device interoperability</span></span></span></p></li><li dir=\"ltr\" style=\"list-style-type: disc; font-size: 9pt; font-family: Poppins, sans-serif; color: rgb(0, 0, 0); background-color: transparent; font-variant-numeric: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; font-variant-alternates: normal; font-variant-position: normal; font-variant-emoji: normal; vertical-align: baseline; white-space: pre; margin-left: 77.35pt;\" aria-level=\"1\"><p dir=\"ltr\" style=\"line-height:1.2;margin-top:5pt;margin-bottom:5pt;\" role=\"presentation\"><span style=\"font-size: 11pt; background-color: transparent; font-variant-numeric: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; font-variant-alternates: normal; font-variant-position: normal; font-variant-emoji: normal; vertical-align: baseline; text-wrap-mode: wrap;\"><span style=\"font-size: 18px;\"><span style=\"font-family: var(--font-inter), Inter, sans-serif;\">Simultaneity with thousands of people interacting at the same time</span></span></span></p></li><li dir=\"ltr\" style=\"list-style-type: disc; font-size: 9pt; font-family: Poppins, sans-serif; color: rgb(0, 0, 0); background-color: transparent; font-variant-numeric: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; font-variant-alternates: normal; font-variant-position: normal; font-variant-emoji: normal; vertical-align: baseline; white-space: pre; margin-left: 77.35pt;\" aria-level=\"1\"><p dir=\"ltr\" style=\"line-height:1.2;margin-top:5pt;margin-bottom:5pt;\" role=\"presentation\"><span style=\"font-size: 11pt; background-color: transparent; font-variant-numeric: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; font-variant-alternates: normal; font-variant-position: normal; font-variant-emoji: normal; vertical-align: baseline; text-wrap-mode: wrap;\"><span style=\"font-size: 18px;\"><span style=\"font-family: var(--font-inter), Inter, sans-serif;\">Use cases that span human activities far beyond games</span></span></span></p></li></ul></span>\n\n</div>',1,0,70,'2025-09-12 07:20:05','2025-10-08 10:30:13'),(229,36,'Layers Metaverse','<div class=\"prose prose-lg max-w-none space-y-4\">\n\n<span id=\"docs-internal-guid-b3d7638f-7fff-b440-4af5-3123f6a1fad8\"><p dir=\"ltr\" style=\"line-height:1.2;margin-top:5pt;margin-bottom:5pt;\"><span style=\"font-size: 11pt; font-family: Poppins, sans-serif; color: rgb(0, 0, 0); background-color: transparent; font-variant-numeric: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; font-variant-alternates: normal; font-variant-position: normal; font-variant-emoji: normal; vertical-align: baseline; white-space-collapse: preserve;\"><span style=\"font-size: 18px;\"><span style=\"font-family: var(--font-inter), Inter, sans-serif;\">There are 10 levels of the metaverse:</span></span></span></p><br><p dir=\"ltr\" style=\"line-height:1.2;margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;\"><span style=\"font-size: 11pt; font-family: Poppins, sans-serif; color: rgb(0, 0, 0); background-color: transparent; font-weight: 700; font-variant-numeric: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; font-variant-alternates: normal; font-variant-position: normal; font-variant-emoji: normal; vertical-align: baseline; white-space-collapse: preserve;\"><span style=\"font-size: 18px;\"><span style=\"font-family: var(--font-inter), Inter, sans-serif;\">1. Content and experiences</span></span></span></p><ol style=\"padding-inline-start: 48px;\"><li dir=\"ltr\" style=\"list-style-type: decimal; font-size: 11pt; font-family: Poppins, sans-serif; color: rgb(0, 0, 0); background-color: transparent; font-variant-numeric: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; font-variant-alternates: normal; font-variant-position: normal; font-variant-emoji: normal; vertical-align: baseline; white-space: pre;\" aria-level=\"1\"><p dir=\"ltr\" style=\"line-height:1.2;margin-top:5pt;margin-bottom:0pt;\" role=\"presentation\"><span style=\"font-size: 11pt; background-color: transparent; font-variant-numeric: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; font-variant-alternates: normal; font-variant-position: normal; font-variant-emoji: normal; vertical-align: baseline; text-wrap-mode: wrap;\"><span style=\"font-size: 18px;\"><span style=\"font-family: var(--font-inter), Inter, sans-serif;\">&nbsp;Virtual worlds: Environments in which a large number of users can gather, interact, create, and move around in different experiences.</span></span></span></p></li><li dir=\"ltr\" style=\"list-style-type: decimal; font-size: 11pt; font-family: Poppins, sans-serif; color: rgb(0, 0, 0); background-color: transparent; font-variant-numeric: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; font-variant-alternates: normal; font-variant-position: normal; font-variant-emoji: normal; vertical-align: baseline; white-space: pre;\" aria-level=\"1\"><p dir=\"ltr\" style=\"line-height:1.2;margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;\" role=\"presentation\"><span style=\"font-size: 11pt; background-color: transparent; font-variant-numeric: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; font-variant-alternates: normal; font-variant-position: normal; font-variant-emoji: normal; vertical-align: baseline; text-wrap-mode: wrap;\"><span style=\"font-size: 18px;\"><span style=\"font-family: var(--font-inter), Inter, sans-serif;\">Applications: Are tied to specific metaverse use cases—from learning to collaboration to events and industry-specific applications.</span></span></span></p></li><li dir=\"ltr\" style=\"list-style-type: decimal; font-size: 11pt; font-family: Poppins, sans-serif; color: rgb(0, 0, 0); background-color: transparent; font-variant-numeric: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; font-variant-alternates: normal; font-variant-position: normal; font-variant-emoji: normal; vertical-align: baseline; white-space: pre;\" aria-level=\"1\"><p dir=\"ltr\" style=\"line-height:1.2;margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:5pt;\" role=\"presentation\"><span style=\"font-size: 11pt; background-color: transparent; font-variant-numeric: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; font-variant-alternates: normal; font-variant-position: normal; font-variant-emoji: normal; vertical-align: baseline; text-wrap-mode: wrap;\"><span style=\"font-size: 18px;\"><span style=\"font-family: var(--font-inter), Inter, sans-serif;\">Content: Enriches the metaverse experiences—including first-party content, developer content, creator content, UGC, etc.</span></span></span></p></li></ol><p dir=\"ltr\" style=\"line-height:1.2;margin-top:5pt;margin-bottom:5pt;\"><span style=\"font-size: 11pt; font-family: Poppins, sans-serif; color: rgb(0, 0, 0); background-color: transparent; font-variant-numeric: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; font-variant-alternates: normal; font-variant-position: normal; font-variant-emoji: normal; vertical-align: baseline; white-space-collapse: preserve;\"><span style=\"font-size: 18px;\"><span style=\"font-family: var(--font-inter), Inter, sans-serif;\">&nbsp;</span></span></span></p><p dir=\"ltr\" style=\"line-height:1.2;margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;\"><span style=\"font-size: 11pt; font-family: Poppins, sans-serif; color: rgb(0, 0, 0); background-color: transparent; font-weight: 700; font-variant-numeric: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; font-variant-alternates: normal; font-variant-position: normal; font-variant-emoji: normal; vertical-align: baseline; white-space-collapse: preserve;\"><span style=\"font-size: 18px;\"><span style=\"font-family: var(--font-inter), Inter, sans-serif;\">2. Platforms</span></span></span></p><ol style=\"padding-inline-start: 48px;\"><li dir=\"ltr\" style=\"list-style-type: decimal; font-size: 11pt; font-family: Poppins, sans-serif; color: rgb(0, 0, 0); background-color: transparent; font-variant-numeric: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; font-variant-alternates: normal; font-variant-position: normal; font-variant-emoji: normal; vertical-align: baseline; white-space: pre;\" aria-level=\"1\"><p dir=\"ltr\" style=\"line-height:1.2;margin-top:5pt;margin-bottom:0pt;\" role=\"presentation\"><span style=\"font-size: 11pt; background-color: transparent; font-variant-numeric: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; font-variant-alternates: normal; font-variant-position: normal; font-variant-emoji: normal; vertical-align: baseline; text-wrap-mode: wrap;\"><span style=\"font-size: 18px;\"><span style=\"font-family: var(--font-inter), Inter, sans-serif;\">Creator/3D Development Platforms: Essential tools and platforms for developing 3D experiences—including design, game engines, AI services, and creator tools.</span></span></span></p></li><li dir=\"ltr\" style=\"list-style-type: decimal; font-size: 11pt; font-family: Poppins, sans-serif; color: rgb(0, 0, 0); background-color: transparent; font-variant-numeric: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; font-variant-alternates: normal; font-variant-position: normal; font-variant-emoji: normal; vertical-align: baseline; white-space: pre;\" aria-level=\"1\"><p dir=\"ltr\" style=\"line-height:1.2;margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:5pt;\" role=\"presentation\"><span style=\"font-size: 11pt; background-color: transparent; font-variant-numeric: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; font-variant-alternates: normal; font-variant-position: normal; font-variant-emoji: normal; vertical-align: baseline; text-wrap-mode: wrap;\"><span style=\"font-size: 18px;\"><span style=\"font-family: var(--font-inter), Inter, sans-serif;\">Access and discovery: Platforms that facilitate the distribution and discovery of content, experiences, and apps—including browsers, search/visual search, app stores, and in-app storefronts.</span></span></span></p></li></ol><p dir=\"ltr\" style=\"line-height:1.2;margin-top:5pt;margin-bottom:5pt;\"><span style=\"font-size: 11pt; font-family: Poppins, sans-serif; color: rgb(0, 0, 0); background-color: transparent; font-variant-numeric: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; font-variant-alternates: normal; font-variant-position: normal; font-variant-emoji: normal; vertical-align: baseline; white-space-collapse: preserve;\"><span style=\"font-size: 18px;\"><span style=\"font-family: var(--font-inter), Inter, sans-serif;\">&nbsp;</span></span></span></p><p dir=\"ltr\" style=\"line-height:1.2;margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;\"><span style=\"font-size: 11pt; font-family: Poppins, sans-serif; color: rgb(0, 0, 0); background-color: transparent; font-weight: 700; font-variant-numeric: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; font-variant-alternates: normal; font-variant-position: normal; font-variant-emoji: normal; vertical-align: baseline; white-space-collapse: preserve;\"><span style=\"font-size: 18px;\"><span style=\"font-family: var(--font-inter), Inter, sans-serif;\">3. Infrastructure and hardware</span></span></span></p><ol style=\"padding-inline-start: 48px;\"><li dir=\"ltr\" style=\"list-style-type: decimal; font-size: 11pt; font-family: Poppins, sans-serif; color: rgb(0, 0, 0); background-color: transparent; font-variant-numeric: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; font-variant-alternates: normal; font-variant-position: normal; font-variant-emoji: normal; vertical-align: baseline; white-space: pre;\" aria-level=\"1\"><p dir=\"ltr\" style=\"line-height:1.2;margin-top:5pt;margin-bottom:0pt;\" role=\"presentation\"><span style=\"font-size: 11pt; background-color: transparent; font-variant-numeric: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; font-variant-alternates: normal; font-variant-position: normal; font-variant-emoji: normal; vertical-align: baseline; text-wrap-mode: wrap;\"><span style=\"font-size: 18px;\"><span style=\"font-family: var(--font-inter), Inter, sans-serif;\">Infrastructure: The underlying infrastructure of cloud, semiconductors, networks, etc., that powers the metaverse.</span></span></span></p></li><li dir=\"ltr\" style=\"list-style-type: decimal; font-size: 11pt; font-family: Poppins, sans-serif; color: rgb(0, 0, 0); background-color: transparent; font-variant-numeric: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; font-variant-alternates: normal; font-variant-position: normal; font-variant-emoji: normal; vertical-align: baseline; white-space: pre;\" aria-level=\"1\"><p dir=\"ltr\" style=\"line-height:1.2;margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:5pt;\" role=\"presentation\"><span style=\"font-size: 11pt; background-color: transparent; font-variant-numeric: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; font-variant-alternates: normal; font-variant-position: normal; font-variant-emoji: normal; vertical-align: baseline; text-wrap-mode: wrap;\"><span style=\"font-size: 18px;\"><span style=\"font-family: var(--font-inter), Inter, sans-serif;\">&nbsp;Devices, Operating Systems, and Accessories: Device hardware, components, accessories/peripherals, and operating systems that are part of the human user interface.</span></span></span></p></li></ol><p dir=\"ltr\" style=\"line-height:1.2;margin-top:5pt;margin-bottom:5pt;\"><span style=\"font-size: 11pt; font-family: Poppins, sans-serif; color: rgb(0, 0, 0); background-color: transparent; font-variant-numeric: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; font-variant-alternates: normal; font-variant-position: normal; font-variant-emoji: normal; vertical-align: baseline; white-space-collapse: preserve;\"><span style=\"font-size: 18px;\"><span style=\"font-family: var(--font-inter), Inter, sans-serif;\">&nbsp;</span></span></span></p><p dir=\"ltr\" style=\"line-height:1.2;margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;\"><span style=\"font-size: 11pt; font-family: Poppins, sans-serif; color: rgb(0, 0, 0); background-color: transparent; font-weight: 700; font-variant-numeric: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; font-variant-alternates: normal; font-variant-position: normal; font-variant-emoji: normal; vertical-align: baseline; white-space-collapse: preserve;\"><span style=\"font-size: 18px;\"><span style=\"font-family: var(--font-inter), Inter, sans-serif;\">4. Enablers</span></span></span></p><ol style=\"padding-inline-start: 48px;\"><li dir=\"ltr\" style=\"list-style-type: decimal; font-size: 11pt; font-family: Poppins, sans-serif; color: rgb(0, 0, 0); background-color: transparent; font-variant-numeric: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; font-variant-alternates: normal; font-variant-position: normal; font-variant-emoji: normal; vertical-align: baseline; white-space: pre;\" aria-level=\"1\"><p dir=\"ltr\" style=\"line-height:1.2;margin-top:5pt;margin-bottom:0pt;\" role=\"presentation\"><span style=\"font-size: 11pt; background-color: transparent; font-variant-numeric: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; font-variant-alternates: normal; font-variant-position: normal; font-variant-emoji: normal; vertical-align: baseline; text-wrap-mode: wrap;\"><span style=\"font-size: 18px;\"><span style=\"font-family: var(--font-inter), Inter, sans-serif;\">&nbsp;Payments and monetization: Platforms and tools (e.g., advertising, asset stores) to enable the metaverse economy</span></span></span></p></li><li dir=\"ltr\" style=\"list-style-type: decimal; font-size: 11pt; font-family: Poppins, sans-serif; color: rgb(0, 0, 0); background-color: transparent; font-variant-numeric: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; font-variant-alternates: normal; font-variant-position: normal; font-variant-emoji: normal; vertical-align: baseline; white-space: pre;\" aria-level=\"1\"><p dir=\"ltr\" style=\"line-height:1.2;margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;\" role=\"presentation\"><span style=\"font-size: 11pt; background-color: transparent; font-variant-numeric: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; font-variant-alternates: normal; font-variant-position: normal; font-variant-emoji: normal; vertical-align: baseline; text-wrap-mode: wrap;\"><span style=\"font-size: 18px;\"><span style=\"font-family: var(--font-inter), Inter, sans-serif;\">Identity: Platforms that manage digital identity, avatars, and social graphs</span></span></span></p></li><li dir=\"ltr\" style=\"list-style-type: decimal; font-size: 11pt; font-family: Poppins, sans-serif; color: rgb(0, 0, 0); background-color: transparent; font-variant-numeric: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; font-variant-alternates: normal; font-variant-position: normal; font-variant-emoji: normal; vertical-align: baseline; white-space: pre;\" aria-level=\"1\"><p dir=\"ltr\" style=\"line-height:1.2;margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:5pt;\" role=\"presentation\"><span style=\"font-size: 11pt; background-color: transparent; font-variant-numeric: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; font-variant-alternates: normal; font-variant-position: normal; font-variant-emoji: normal; vertical-align: baseline; text-wrap-mode: wrap;\"><span style=\"font-size: 18px;\"><span style=\"font-family: var(--font-inter), Inter, sans-serif;\">Security, privacy, and governance: Platforms for security, identity and data management, privacy, and content moderation</span></span></span></p></li></ol><p dir=\"ltr\" style=\"line-height:1.2;margin-top:5pt;margin-bottom:5pt;\"><span style=\"font-size: 11pt; font-family: Poppins, sans-serif; color: rgb(0, 0, 0); background-color: transparent; font-variant-numeric: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; font-variant-alternates: normal; font-variant-position: normal; font-variant-emoji: normal; vertical-align: baseline; white-space-collapse: preserve;\"><span style=\"font-size: 18px;\"><span style=\"font-family: var(--font-inter), Inter, sans-serif;\">&nbsp;</span></span></span></p><p dir=\"ltr\" style=\"line-height:1.2;margin-top:5pt;margin-bottom:5pt;\"><span style=\"font-size: 11pt; font-family: Poppins, sans-serif; color: rgb(0, 0, 0); background-color: transparent; font-variant-numeric: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; font-variant-alternates: normal; font-variant-position: normal; font-variant-emoji: normal; vertical-align: baseline; white-space-collapse: preserve;\"><span style=\"font-size: 18px;\"><span style=\"font-family: var(--font-inter), Inter, sans-serif;\">Three steps to capture value:</span></span></span></p><ol style=\"padding-inline-start: 48px;\"><li dir=\"ltr\" style=\"list-style-type: decimal; font-size: 11pt; font-family: Poppins, sans-serif; color: rgb(0, 0, 0); background-color: transparent; font-variant-numeric: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; font-variant-alternates: normal; font-variant-position: normal; font-variant-emoji: normal; vertical-align: baseline; white-space: pre; margin-left: 77.35pt;\" aria-level=\"1\"><p dir=\"ltr\" style=\"line-height:1.2;margin-top:5pt;margin-bottom:5pt;\" role=\"presentation\"><span style=\"font-size: 11pt; background-color: transparent; font-variant-numeric: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; font-variant-alternates: normal; font-variant-position: normal; font-variant-emoji: normal; vertical-align: baseline; text-wrap-mode: wrap;\"><span style=\"font-size: 18px;\"><span style=\"font-family: var(--font-inter), Inter, sans-serif;\">Develop a value-focused strategy: Define your goals and the role you want to play in creating value.</span></span></span></p></li><li dir=\"ltr\" style=\"list-style-type: decimal; font-size: 11pt; font-family: Poppins, sans-serif; color: rgb(0, 0, 0); background-color: transparent; font-variant-numeric: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; font-variant-alternates: normal; font-variant-position: normal; font-variant-emoji: normal; vertical-align: baseline; white-space: pre; margin-left: 77.35pt;\" aria-level=\"1\"><p dir=\"ltr\" style=\"line-height:1.2;margin-top:5pt;margin-bottom:5pt;\" role=\"presentation\"><span style=\"font-size: 11pt; background-color: transparent; font-variant-numeric: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; font-variant-alternates: normal; font-variant-position: normal; font-variant-emoji: normal; vertical-align: baseline; text-wrap-mode: wrap;\"><span style=\"font-size: 18px;\"><span style=\"font-family: var(--font-inter), Inter, sans-serif;\">Test, learn, and adopt: Start initial activities, monitor results, and renew.</span></span></span></p></li><li dir=\"ltr\" style=\"list-style-type: decimal; font-size: 11pt; font-family: Poppins, sans-serif; color: rgb(0, 0, 0); background-color: transparent; font-variant-numeric: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; font-variant-alternates: normal; font-variant-position: normal; font-variant-emoji: normal; vertical-align: baseline; white-space: pre; margin-left: 77.35pt;\" aria-level=\"1\"><p dir=\"ltr\" style=\"line-height:1.2;margin-top:5pt;margin-bottom:5pt;\" role=\"presentation\"><span style=\"font-size: 11pt; background-color: transparent; font-variant-numeric: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; font-variant-alternates: normal; font-variant-position: normal; font-variant-emoji: normal; vertical-align: baseline; text-wrap-mode: wrap;\"><span style=\"font-size: 18px;\"><span style=\"font-family: var(--font-inter), Inter, sans-serif;\">Prepare to scale: align talent and technical skills, and embed them in your business strategy and operating model.</span></span></span></p></li></ol><p dir=\"ltr\" style=\"line-height:1.2;margin-top:5pt;margin-bottom:5pt;\"><span style=\"font-size: 11pt; font-family: Poppins, sans-serif; color: rgb(0, 0, 0); background-color: transparent; font-variant-numeric: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; font-variant-alternates: normal; font-variant-position: normal; font-variant-emoji: normal; vertical-align: baseline; white-space-collapse: preserve;\"><span style=\"font-size: 18px;\"><span style=\"font-family: var(--font-inter), Inter, sans-serif;\">There are no multiple metaverses:</span></span></span></p><p dir=\"ltr\" style=\"line-height:1.2;margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;\"><span style=\"font-size: 11pt; font-family: Poppins, sans-serif; color: rgb(0, 0, 0); background-color: transparent; font-variant-numeric: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; font-variant-alternates: normal; font-variant-position: normal; font-variant-emoji: normal; vertical-align: baseline; white-space-collapse: preserve;\"><span style=\"font-size: 18px;\"><span style=\"font-family: var(--font-inter), Inter, sans-serif;\">Saying that there are many metaverses is like saying that there are many internets. The metaverse is the desired end state that encompasses all digital worlds besides the physical world, with interoperability between them all. As it stands now, the users of the metaverse are spread across multiple platforms, for example, Decentraland, Fortnite, Minecraft, Roblox, and The Sandbox.</span></span></span></p><p dir=\"ltr\" style=\"line-height:1.2;margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;\"><span style=\"font-size: 11pt; font-family: Poppins, sans-serif; color: rgb(0, 0, 0); background-color: transparent; font-variant-numeric: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; font-variant-alternates: normal; font-variant-position: normal; font-variant-emoji: normal; vertical-align: baseline; white-space-collapse: preserve;\"><span style=\"font-size: 18px;\"><span style=\"font-family: var(--font-inter), Inter, sans-serif;\">The history of the metaverse:\n\n</span></span></span></p><p dir=\"ltr\" style=\"line-height:1.2;margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;\"><span style=\"font-size: 11pt; font-family: Poppins, sans-serif; color: rgb(0, 0, 0); background-color: transparent; font-variant-numeric: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; font-variant-alternates: normal; font-variant-position: normal; font-variant-emoji: normal; vertical-align: baseline; white-space-collapse: preserve;\"><span style=\"font-size: 18px;\"><span style=\"font-family: var(--font-inter), Inter, sans-serif;\"><img src=\"https://ptgr-bucket.s3.us-east-1.amazonaws.com/chapter5/1.png\" alt=\"Image\" class=\"max-w-full h-auto rounded-lg my-4 cursor-move hover:ring-2 hover:ring-primary/50 transition-all\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" style=\"max-width: 100%; height: auto;\"><br></span></span></span></p><p dir=\"ltr\" style=\"line-height:1.2;margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;\"><span style=\"font-size:8pt;font-family:Poppins,sans-serif;color:#000000;background-color:transparent;font-weight:400;font-style:normal;font-variant:normal;text-decoration:none;vertical-align:baseline;white-space:pre;white-space:pre-wrap;\"><span style=\"font-size: 18px;\"><span style=\"font-family: var(--font-inter), Inter, sans-serif;\"><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">Figure 1: The history of metaverse</span></span></span></span></p><p dir=\"ltr\" style=\"line-height:1.2;margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;\"><span style=\"font-size:8pt;font-family:Poppins,sans-serif;color:#000000;background-color:transparent;font-weight:400;font-style:normal;font-variant:normal;text-decoration:none;vertical-align:baseline;white-space:pre;white-space:pre-wrap;\"><span style=\"font-size: 18px;\"><span style=\"font-family: var(--font-inter), Inter, sans-serif;\"><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">(Source: Value creation in the metaverse. McKinsey &amp; Company, June 2022)</span></span></span></span></p><p dir=\"ltr\" style=\"line-height:1.2;margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;\"><span style=\"font-size: 11pt; font-family: Poppins, sans-serif; color: rgb(0, 0, 0); background-color: transparent; font-variant-numeric: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; font-variant-alternates: normal; font-variant-position: normal; font-variant-emoji: normal; vertical-align: baseline; white-space-collapse: preserve;\"><span id=\"docs-internal-guid-9445c2d6-7fff-bfdd-fd0c-c5d21b7733a3\"></span></span></p><div><span style=\"font-size: 11pt; font-family: Poppins, sans-serif; color: rgb(0, 0, 0); background-color: transparent; font-variant-numeric: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; font-variant-alternates: normal; font-variant-position: normal; font-variant-emoji: normal; vertical-align: baseline; white-space-collapse: preserve;\"><br></span>\n</div></span>\n</div>',1,0,70,'2025-09-12 07:23:02','2025-10-08 10:32:35'),(230,36,'Types of the Metaverse','<div class=\"prose prose-lg max-w-none space-y-4\">\n\n<span id=\"docs-internal-guid-1e3aeb0e-7fff-a14c-667e-7a69b8403583\"><p dir=\"ltr\" style=\"line-height:1.2;margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;\"><span style=\"font-size: 11pt; font-family: Poppins, sans-serif; color: rgb(0, 0, 0); background-color: transparent; font-variant-numeric: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; font-variant-alternates: normal; font-variant-position: normal; font-variant-emoji: normal; vertical-align: baseline; white-space-collapse: preserve;\"><span style=\"font-family: var(--font-inter), Inter, sans-serif;\"><span style=\"font-size: 18px;\">Interest in the metaverse has exploded. Global Google searches for \"metaverse\" skyrocketed by 7,200 percent in the last year, and metaverse online gaming platform Roblox reportedly reached more than 55 million daily active users in February 2022. Meta has invested more than $10 billion in its Reality Labs division, which produces metaverse-related hardware such as VR glasses. And Microsoft said that its planned $69 billion acquisition of game maker Activision Blizzard would provide \"building blocks for the metaverse.\" Roblox, which was launched in 2006, has attracted companies like Nike and Gucci as advertisers and partners. Fortnite has more than 20 million daily active users (DAUs), hosted concerts (more than 27 million players attended a Travis Scott performance last April), and generated more than $14 billion in transactions between 2018 and 2020 (DeAcetis, 2021). Naver Z\'s Zepeto—Asia\'s largest metaverse platform—has more than 300 million subscribers worldwide and partnered with Samsung in April for its Galaxy S22 treasure hunt campaign. Virtual real estate is also in the spotlight—an anonymous user has reportedly paid $450,000 to buy a virtual plot of land in The Sandbox next to Snoop Dogg\'s virtual residence, \"Snoopverse.\" Institutional investors cover a wide spectrum, including brands such as Adidas, Samsung, and HSBC, and a fast-growing number of virtual real estate companies such as Republic Realm and Metaverse Group (majority-owned by Tokens.com). And supporting infrastructure is also rapidly evolving, including virtual architecture and consulting firms. However, the price increase is driven by the scarcity inherent in today\'s platforms like Decentraland and The Sandbox. This increases investment risk, even if the companies making these investments aim to take advantage of their virtual real estate, for example, by using it as a metaverse to interact with their customers. They are betting not only on the mass adoption of the metaverse in the coming years but also on the acceptance of the specific platform on which the virtual land is purchased (since interoperability between the worlds is close to zero at the moment). As with cryptocurrencies and NFTs, the virtual real estate market is likely to remain volatile in the near term.\n\n</span></span></span></p><p dir=\"ltr\" style=\"line-height:1.2;margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;\"><span style=\"font-size: 11pt; font-family: Poppins, sans-serif; color: rgb(0, 0, 0); background-color: transparent; font-variant-numeric: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; font-variant-alternates: normal; font-variant-position: normal; font-variant-emoji: normal; vertical-align: baseline; white-space-collapse: preserve;\"><span style=\"font-family: var(--font-inter), Inter, sans-serif;\"><span style=\"font-size: 18px;\"><br></span></span></span></p><p dir=\"ltr\" style=\"line-height:1.2;margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;\"><span style=\"font-size: 11pt; font-family: Poppins, sans-serif; color: rgb(0, 0, 0); background-color: transparent; font-variant-numeric: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; font-variant-alternates: normal; font-variant-position: normal; font-variant-emoji: normal; vertical-align: baseline; white-space-collapse: preserve;\"><span style=\"font-family: var(--font-inter), Inter, sans-serif;\"><span style=\"font-size: 18px;\"><img src=\"https://ptgr-bucket.s3.us-east-1.amazonaws.com/chapter5/2.jpg\" alt=\"Image\" class=\"max-w-full h-auto rounded-lg my-4 cursor-move hover:ring-2 hover:ring-primary/50 transition-all\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" style=\"max-width: 100%; height: auto;\"><br></span></span></span></p><p dir=\"ltr\" style=\"line-height:1.2;margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;\"><span style=\"font-size:8pt;font-family:Poppins,sans-serif;color:#000000;background-color:transparent;font-weight:400;font-style:normal;font-variant:normal;text-decoration:none;vertical-align:baseline;white-space:pre;white-space:pre-wrap;\"><span style=\"font-family: var(--font-inter), Inter, sans-serif;\"><span style=\"font-size: 18px;\"><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">Figure 2:</span></span></span></span></p><p dir=\"ltr\" style=\"line-height:1.2;margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;\"><span style=\"font-size:8pt;font-family:Poppins,sans-serif;color:#000000;background-color:transparent;font-weight:400;font-style:normal;font-variant:normal;text-decoration:none;vertical-align:baseline;white-space:pre;white-space:pre-wrap;\"><span style=\"font-family: var(--font-inter), Inter, sans-serif;\"><span style=\"font-size: 18px;\"><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">Internal corporate investment in 2022 for the 30 largest companies investing in the metaverse, based on publicly disclosed investment amounts.</span></span></span></span></p><p dir=\"ltr\" style=\"line-height:1.2;margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;\"><span style=\"font-size:8pt;font-family:Poppins,sans-serif;color:#000000;background-color:transparent;font-weight:400;font-style:normal;font-variant:normal;text-decoration:none;vertical-align:baseline;white-space:pre;white-space:pre-wrap;\"><span style=\"font-family: var(--font-inter), Inter, sans-serif;\"><span style=\"font-size: 18px;\"><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">(Source: Crunchbase (January 2020-May 2022))</span></span></span></span></p><p dir=\"ltr\" style=\"line-height:1.2;margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;\"><span style=\"font-size: 11pt; font-family: Poppins, sans-serif; color: rgb(0, 0, 0); background-color: transparent; font-variant-numeric: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; font-variant-alternates: normal; font-variant-position: normal; font-variant-emoji: normal; vertical-align: baseline; white-space-collapse: preserve;\"><b style=\"font-weight:normal;\" id=\"docs-internal-guid-3147caa2-7fff-d642-6a4b-f0b22ff559d3\"><br></b></span></p><p dir=\"ltr\" style=\"line-height:1.2;margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;\"><span style=\"font-size:11pt;font-family:Poppins,sans-serif;color:#000000;background-color:transparent;font-weight:400;font-style:normal;font-variant:normal;text-decoration:none;vertical-align:baseline;white-space:pre;white-space:pre-wrap;\"><span style=\"font-family: var(--font-inter), Inter, sans-serif;\"><span style=\"font-size: 18px;\">The industries that are leading the way in the adoption of the metaverse also plan to dedicate a significant portion of their digital investment budgets to the metaverse. Energy (18 percent), automotive, machinery, and assembly (17 percent), high-tech (17 percent), tourism (15 percent), and media and entertainment (15 percent) are among the industries that plan to spend the largest share of their digital budget on activities related to the metaverse in the next three to five years.</span></span></span></p><p dir=\"ltr\" style=\"line-height:1.2;margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;\"><span style=\"font-size: 11pt; font-family: Poppins, sans-serif; color: rgb(0, 0, 0); background-color: transparent; font-variant-numeric: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; font-variant-alternates: normal; font-variant-position: normal; font-variant-emoji: normal; vertical-align: baseline; white-space-collapse: preserve;\"></span></p><div><span style=\"font-size: 11pt; font-family: Poppins, sans-serif; color: rgb(0, 0, 0); background-color: transparent; font-variant-numeric: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; font-variant-alternates: normal; font-variant-position: normal; font-variant-emoji: normal; vertical-align: baseline; white-space-collapse: preserve;\"><span style=\"font-family: var(--font-inter), Inter, sans-serif;\"><span style=\"font-size: 18px;\"><br></span></span></span></div><div><span style=\"font-size: 11pt; font-family: Poppins, sans-serif; color: rgb(0, 0, 0); background-color: transparent; font-variant-numeric: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; font-variant-alternates: normal; font-variant-position: normal; font-variant-emoji: normal; vertical-align: baseline; white-space-collapse: preserve;\"><span style=\"font-family: var(--font-inter), Inter, sans-serif;\"><span style=\"font-size: 18px;\"><img src=\"https://ptgr-bucket.s3.us-east-1.amazonaws.com/chapter5/3.jpg\" alt=\"Image\" class=\"max-w-full h-auto rounded-lg my-4 cursor-move hover:ring-2 hover:ring-primary/50 transition-all\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" style=\"max-width: 100%; height: auto;\">\n</span></span><span id=\"docs-internal-guid-a9617b9c-7fff-55b7-8e0d-e2be98150c23\"><p dir=\"ltr\" style=\"line-height:1.2;margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;\"><span style=\"font-size: 8pt; background-color: transparent; font-variant-numeric: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; font-variant-alternates: normal; font-variant-position: normal; font-variant-emoji: normal; vertical-align: baseline;\"><span style=\"font-family: var(--font-inter), Inter, sans-serif;\"><span style=\"font-size: 18px;\"><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">Figure 3:</span></span></span></span></p><p dir=\"ltr\" style=\"line-height:1.2;margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;\"><span style=\"font-size: 8pt; background-color: transparent; font-variant-numeric: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; font-variant-alternates: normal; font-variant-position: normal; font-variant-emoji: normal; vertical-align: baseline;\"><span style=\"font-family: var(--font-inter), Inter, sans-serif;\"><span style=\"font-size: 18px;\"><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">Apparel, footwear, and luxury goods.</span></span></span></span></p><p dir=\"ltr\" style=\"line-height:1.2;margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;\"><span style=\"font-size: 8pt; background-color: transparent; font-variant-numeric: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; font-variant-alternates: normal; font-variant-position: normal; font-variant-emoji: normal; vertical-align: baseline;\"><span style=\"font-family: var(--font-inter), Inter, sans-serif;\"><span style=\"font-size: 18px;\"><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">(Source: McKinsey &amp; Company Senior Executives Survey, April 2022)</span></span></span></span></p><br><p dir=\"ltr\" style=\"line-height:1.2;margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;\"><span style=\"font-size: 11pt; background-color: transparent; font-weight: 700; font-variant-numeric: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; font-variant-alternates: normal; font-variant-position: normal; font-variant-emoji: normal; vertical-align: baseline;\"><span style=\"font-family: var(--font-inter), Inter, sans-serif;\"><span style=\"font-size: 18px;\">The broader investment landscape is dominated by three categories of investors:</span></span></span></p><p dir=\"ltr\" style=\"line-height:1.2;margin-top:5pt;margin-bottom:5pt;\"><span style=\"font-size: 11pt; background-color: transparent; font-variant-numeric: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; font-variant-alternates: normal; font-variant-position: normal; font-variant-emoji: normal; vertical-align: baseline;\"><span style=\"font-family: var(--font-inter), Inter, sans-serif;\"><span style=\"font-size: 18px;\">Major tech companies, including Meta, Microsoft, Nvidia, Apple, and Alphabet, are taking deliberate action to shape the metaverse.</span></span></span></p><p dir=\"ltr\" style=\"line-height:1.2;margin-top:5pt;margin-bottom:5pt;\"><span style=\"font-size: 11pt; background-color: transparent; font-variant-numeric: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; font-variant-alternates: normal; font-variant-position: normal; font-variant-emoji: normal; vertical-align: baseline;\"><span style=\"font-family: var(--font-inter), Inter, sans-serif;\"><span style=\"font-size: 18px;\">The most prominent example is Facebook\'s name change to Meta, which reaffirms the company\'s intention to be a leader in the space. Other examples include Microsoft\'s planned acquisition of Activision Blizzard, Nvidia\'s Omniverse, the planned release of Sony\'s PlayStation VR2 headset later this year, and Apple\'s potential entry into the AR space in 2023. Venture capital invests heavily in this area. Examples include NFT marketplace OpenSea, which is raising $300 million at a $13.3 billion valuation in a Series C funding round led by Paradigm and Coatue, metaverse technology company Improbable, which is raising $150 million led by Andreessen Horowitz and SoftBank; Yuga Labs (creator of the Bored Ape Yacht Club), which is raising $450 million at a $4 billion valuation to build a virtual world; The Sandbox, which will receive $93 million from SoftBank; and Niantic, which will receive $300 million from Coatue. Companies and brands outside of technology are deploying resources to move forward. Disney, for example, has appointed a senior executive to oversee its metaverse strategy, while LEGO has invested in Epic Games (maker of Fortnite). Epic Games has also collaborated with luxury brand Balenciaga, which has launched its own metaverse division and showcased its latest collection in a virtual space. Recent technological trends and advancements such as e-commerce, smart devices, and social media are arguably starting to reach a point where their ability to create a competitive advantage is waning. In response, brands are looking for innovative ways to stay ahead of the competition. With its growing number of use cases, the metaverse offers growth opportunities that first-to-market brands are eager to explore and develop.</span></span></span></p><p dir=\"ltr\" style=\"line-height:1.2;margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;\"><span style=\"font-size: 11pt; background-color: transparent; font-weight: 700; font-variant-numeric: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; font-variant-alternates: normal; font-variant-position: normal; font-variant-emoji: normal; vertical-align: baseline;\"><span style=\"font-family: var(--font-inter), Inter, sans-serif;\"><span style=\"font-size: 18px;\">Example of use cases in metaverse use</span></span></span></p><p dir=\"ltr\" style=\"line-height:1.2;margin-top:5pt;margin-bottom:5pt;\"><span style=\"font-size: 11pt; background-color: transparent; font-variant-numeric: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; font-variant-alternates: normal; font-variant-position: normal; font-variant-emoji: normal; vertical-align: baseline;\"><span style=\"font-family: var(--font-inter), Inter, sans-serif;\"><span style=\"font-size: 18px;\">Companies from various industries are experimenting with the metaverse in everything from marketing to education to commerce. Here are some leading examples:</span></span></span></p><ul style=\"padding-inline-start: 48px;\"><li dir=\"ltr\" style=\"list-style-type: disc; font-size: 9pt; background-color: transparent; font-variant-numeric: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; font-variant-alternates: normal; font-variant-position: normal; font-variant-emoji: normal; vertical-align: baseline; text-wrap-mode: nowrap; margin-left: 77.35pt;\" aria-level=\"1\"><p dir=\"ltr\" style=\"line-height:1.2;margin-top:5pt;margin-bottom:5pt;\" role=\"presentation\"><span style=\"font-size: 11pt; background-color: transparent; font-variant-numeric: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; font-variant-alternates: normal; font-variant-position: normal; font-variant-emoji: normal; vertical-align: baseline; text-wrap-mode: wrap;\"><span style=\"font-family: var(--font-inter), Inter, sans-serif;\"><span style=\"font-size: 18px;\">Product marketing: Coca-Cola has launched digital assets to support various marketing campaigns, such as auctioning NFT collectible cards for International Friendship Day.</span></span></span></p></li><li dir=\"ltr\" style=\"list-style-type: disc; font-size: 9pt; background-color: transparent; font-variant-numeric: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; font-variant-alternates: normal; font-variant-position: normal; font-variant-emoji: normal; vertical-align: baseline; text-wrap-mode: nowrap; margin-left: 77.35pt;\" aria-level=\"1\"><p dir=\"ltr\" style=\"line-height:1.2;margin-top:5pt;margin-bottom:5pt;\" role=\"presentation\"><span style=\"font-size: 11pt; background-color: transparent; font-variant-numeric: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; font-variant-alternates: normal; font-variant-position: normal; font-variant-emoji: normal; vertical-align: baseline; text-wrap-mode: wrap;\"><span style=\"font-family: var(--font-inter), Inter, sans-serif;\"><span style=\"font-size: 18px;\">Customer engagement: Gucci launched its Gucci Garden on Roblox, a series of branded-themed spaces aligned with the launch of a similar physical space.</span></span></span></p></li><li dir=\"ltr\" style=\"list-style-type: disc; font-size: 9pt; background-color: transparent; font-variant-numeric: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; font-variant-alternates: normal; font-variant-position: normal; font-variant-emoji: normal; vertical-align: baseline; text-wrap-mode: nowrap; margin-left: 77.35pt;\" aria-level=\"1\"><p dir=\"ltr\" style=\"line-height:1.2;margin-top:5pt;margin-bottom:5pt;\" role=\"presentation\"><span style=\"font-size: 11pt; background-color: transparent; font-variant-numeric: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; font-variant-alternates: normal; font-variant-position: normal; font-variant-emoji: normal; vertical-align: baseline; text-wrap-mode: wrap;\"><span style=\"font-family: var(--font-inter), Inter, sans-serif;\"><span style=\"font-size: 18px;\">Next-generation commerce: AnamXR uses game engine technology to create cloud-based, virtual e-commerce platforms for 3D shopping experiences.</span></span></span></p></li><li dir=\"ltr\" style=\"list-style-type: disc; font-size: 9pt; background-color: transparent; font-variant-numeric: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; font-variant-alternates: normal; font-variant-position: normal; font-variant-emoji: normal; vertical-align: baseline; text-wrap-mode: nowrap; margin-left: 77.35pt;\" aria-level=\"1\"><p dir=\"ltr\" style=\"line-height:1.2;margin-top:5pt;margin-bottom:5pt;\" role=\"presentation\"><span style=\"font-size: 11pt; background-color: transparent; font-variant-numeric: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; font-variant-alternates: normal; font-variant-position: normal; font-variant-emoji: normal; vertical-align: baseline; text-wrap-mode: wrap;\"><span style=\"font-family: var(--font-inter), Inter, sans-serif;\"><span style=\"font-size: 18px;\">Brand loyalty: Adidas\' Bored Ape Yacht Club NFT release provided access to physical streetwear drops, fostered brand loyalty, and created a community around the virtual goods.</span></span></span></p></li><li dir=\"ltr\" style=\"list-style-type: disc; font-size: 9pt; background-color: transparent; font-variant-numeric: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; font-variant-alternates: normal; font-variant-position: normal; font-variant-emoji: normal; vertical-align: baseline; text-wrap-mode: nowrap; margin-left: 77.35pt;\" aria-level=\"1\"><p dir=\"ltr\" style=\"line-height:1.2;margin-top:5pt;margin-bottom:5pt;\" role=\"presentation\"><span style=\"font-size: 11pt; background-color: transparent; font-variant-numeric: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; font-variant-alternates: normal; font-variant-position: normal; font-variant-emoji: normal; vertical-align: baseline; text-wrap-mode: wrap;\"><span style=\"font-family: var(--font-inter), Inter, sans-serif;\"><span style=\"font-size: 18px;\">Customer support: Helpshift is rolling out solutions for customer support tools in the metaverse, including user feedback, virtual identity verification, and VR support.</span></span></span></p></li><li dir=\"ltr\" style=\"list-style-type: disc; font-size: 9pt; background-color: transparent; font-variant-numeric: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; font-variant-alternates: normal; font-variant-position: normal; font-variant-emoji: normal; vertical-align: baseline; text-wrap-mode: nowrap; margin-left: 77.35pt;\" aria-level=\"1\"><p dir=\"ltr\" style=\"line-height:1.2;margin-top:5pt;margin-bottom:5pt;\" role=\"presentation\"><span style=\"font-size: 11pt; background-color: transparent; font-variant-numeric: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; font-variant-alternates: normal; font-variant-position: normal; font-variant-emoji: normal; vertical-align: baseline; text-wrap-mode: wrap;\"><span style=\"font-family: var(--font-inter), Inter, sans-serif;\"><span style=\"font-size: 18px;\">Recruitment: Havas Group has set up a village within The Sandbox to provide recruitment services for enhanced applicant and onboarding experiences.</span></span></span></p></li><li dir=\"ltr\" style=\"list-style-type: disc; font-size: 9pt; background-color: transparent; font-variant-numeric: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; font-variant-alternates: normal; font-variant-position: normal; font-variant-emoji: normal; vertical-align: baseline; text-wrap-mode: nowrap; margin-left: 77.35pt;\" aria-level=\"1\"><p dir=\"ltr\" style=\"line-height:1.2;margin-top:5pt;margin-bottom:5pt;\" role=\"presentation\"><span style=\"font-size: 11pt; background-color: transparent; font-variant-numeric: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; font-variant-alternates: normal; font-variant-position: normal; font-variant-emoji: normal; vertical-align: baseline; text-wrap-mode: wrap;\"><span style=\"font-family: var(--font-inter), Inter, sans-serif;\"><span style=\"font-size: 18px;\">Digital twins: BMW is experimenting with creating digital twins of entire factories and developing products using Nvidia\'s Omniverse technology.</span></span></span></p></li><li dir=\"ltr\" style=\"list-style-type: disc; font-size: 9pt; background-color: transparent; font-variant-numeric: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; font-variant-alternates: normal; font-variant-position: normal; font-variant-emoji: normal; vertical-align: baseline; text-wrap-mode: nowrap; margin-left: 77.35pt;\" aria-level=\"1\"><p dir=\"ltr\" style=\"line-height:1.2;margin-top:5pt;margin-bottom:5pt;\" role=\"presentation\"><span style=\"font-size: 11pt; background-color: transparent; font-variant-numeric: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; font-variant-alternates: normal; font-variant-position: normal; font-variant-emoji: normal; vertical-align: baseline; text-wrap-mode: wrap;\"><span style=\"font-family: var(--font-inter), Inter, sans-serif;\"><span style=\"font-size: 18px;\">Public services: Seoul plans to become the first city to operate a metaverse platform for public services by 2023.</span></span></span></p></li><li dir=\"ltr\" style=\"list-style-type: disc; font-size: 9pt; background-color: transparent; font-variant-numeric: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; font-variant-alternates: normal; font-variant-position: normal; font-variant-emoji: normal; vertical-align: baseline; text-wrap-mode: nowrap; margin-left: 77.35pt;\" aria-level=\"1\"><p dir=\"ltr\" style=\"line-height:1.2;margin-top:5pt;margin-bottom:5pt;\" role=\"presentation\"><span style=\"font-size: 11pt; background-color: transparent; font-variant-numeric: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; font-variant-alternates: normal; font-variant-position: normal; font-variant-emoji: normal; vertical-align: baseline; text-wrap-mode: wrap;\"><span style=\"font-family: var(--font-inter), Inter, sans-serif;\"><span style=\"font-size: 18px;\">Virtual Tourism: Ariva Digital\'s Wonderland platform is working to enable users to travel to imaginary or recreated destinations.</span></span></span></p></li></ul><p dir=\"ltr\" style=\"line-height:1.2;margin-top:5pt;margin-bottom:5pt;\"><span style=\"font-size: 11pt; background-color: transparent; font-variant-numeric: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; font-variant-alternates: normal; font-variant-position: normal; font-variant-emoji: normal; vertical-align: baseline;\"><span style=\"font-family: var(--font-inter), Inter, sans-serif;\"><span style=\"font-size: 18px;\">&nbsp;</span></span></span></p><p dir=\"ltr\" style=\"line-height:1.2;margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;\"><span style=\"font-size: 11pt; background-color: transparent; font-weight: 700; font-variant-numeric: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; font-variant-alternates: normal; font-variant-position: normal; font-variant-emoji: normal; vertical-align: baseline;\"><span style=\"font-family: var(--font-inter), Inter, sans-serif;\"><span style=\"font-size: 18px;\">Long-term visions of the metaverse for everyday life</span></span></span></p><ol style=\"padding-inline-start: 48px;\"><li dir=\"ltr\" style=\"list-style-type: decimal; font-size: 11pt; background-color: transparent; font-variant-numeric: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; font-variant-alternates: normal; font-variant-position: normal; font-variant-emoji: normal; vertical-align: baseline; text-wrap-mode: nowrap; margin-left: 77.35pt;\" aria-level=\"1\"><p dir=\"ltr\" style=\"line-height:1.2;margin-top:5pt;margin-bottom:5pt;\" role=\"presentation\"><span style=\"font-size: 11pt; background-color: transparent; font-variant-numeric: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; font-variant-alternates: normal; font-variant-position: normal; font-variant-emoji: normal; vertical-align: baseline; text-wrap-mode: wrap;\"><span style=\"font-family: var(--font-inter), Inter, sans-serif;\"><span style=\"font-size: 18px;\">Gaming has driven the development of the metaverse.</span></span></span></p></li><li dir=\"ltr\" style=\"list-style-type: decimal; font-size: 11pt; background-color: transparent; font-variant-numeric: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; font-variant-alternates: normal; font-variant-position: normal; font-variant-emoji: normal; vertical-align: baseline; text-wrap-mode: nowrap; margin-left: 77.35pt;\" aria-level=\"1\"><p dir=\"ltr\" style=\"line-height:1.2;margin-top:5pt;margin-bottom:5pt;\" role=\"presentation\"><span style=\"font-size: 11pt; background-color: transparent; font-variant-numeric: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; font-variant-alternates: normal; font-variant-position: normal; font-variant-emoji: normal; vertical-align: baseline; text-wrap-mode: wrap;\"><span style=\"font-family: var(--font-inter), Inter, sans-serif;\"><span style=\"font-size: 18px;\">Socialization expands existing consumer behavior through platforms like Decentraland, The Sandbox, and Second Life.</span></span></span></p></li><li dir=\"ltr\" style=\"list-style-type: decimal; font-size: 11pt; background-color: transparent; font-variant-numeric: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; font-variant-alternates: normal; font-variant-position: normal; font-variant-emoji: normal; vertical-align: baseline; text-wrap-mode: nowrap; margin-left: 77.35pt;\" aria-level=\"1\"><p dir=\"ltr\" style=\"line-height:1.2;margin-top:5pt;margin-bottom:5pt;\" role=\"presentation\"><span style=\"font-size: 11pt; background-color: transparent; font-variant-numeric: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; font-variant-alternates: normal; font-variant-position: normal; font-variant-emoji: normal; vertical-align: baseline; text-wrap-mode: wrap;\"><span style=\"font-family: var(--font-inter), Inter, sans-serif;\"><span style=\"font-size: 18px;\">Fitness often combines gaming and connectivity through providers like Peloton.</span></span></span></p></li><li dir=\"ltr\" style=\"list-style-type: decimal; font-size: 11pt; background-color: transparent; font-variant-numeric: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; font-variant-alternates: normal; font-variant-position: normal; font-variant-emoji: normal; vertical-align: baseline; text-wrap-mode: nowrap; margin-left: 77.35pt;\" aria-level=\"1\"><p dir=\"ltr\" style=\"line-height:1.2;margin-top:5pt;margin-bottom:5pt;\" role=\"presentation\"><span style=\"font-size: 11pt; background-color: transparent; font-variant-numeric: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; font-variant-alternates: normal; font-variant-position: normal; font-variant-emoji: normal; vertical-align: baseline; text-wrap-mode: wrap;\"><span style=\"font-family: var(--font-inter), Inter, sans-serif;\"><span style=\"font-size: 18px;\">The trade includes Sotheby\'s own marketplace for curated NFT art, the virtual-only fashion company Fabricant, as well as startups promoting an immersive retail experience, including Obsess and AnamXR. An important question is whether the metaverse can be a channel for selling real-world products at scale. New technologies that allow thousands of people to interact at the same time could help with this.</span></span></span></p></li><li dir=\"ltr\" style=\"list-style-type: decimal; font-size: 11pt; background-color: transparent; font-variant-numeric: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; font-variant-alternates: normal; font-variant-position: normal; font-variant-emoji: normal; vertical-align: baseline; text-wrap-mode: nowrap; margin-left: 77.35pt;\" aria-level=\"1\"><p dir=\"ltr\" style=\"line-height:1.2;margin-top:5pt;margin-bottom:5pt;\" role=\"presentation\"><span style=\"font-size: 11pt; background-color: transparent; font-variant-numeric: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; font-variant-alternates: normal; font-variant-position: normal; font-variant-emoji: normal; vertical-align: baseline; text-wrap-mode: wrap;\"><span style=\"font-family: var(--font-inter), Inter, sans-serif;\"><span style=\"font-size: 18px;\">Distance learning groups individuals in virtual classrooms</span></span></span></p></li><li dir=\"ltr\" style=\"list-style-type: decimal; font-size: 11pt; background-color: transparent; font-variant-numeric: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; font-variant-alternates: normal; font-variant-position: normal; font-variant-emoji: normal; vertical-align: baseline; text-wrap-mode: nowrap; margin-left: 77.35pt;\" aria-level=\"1\"><p dir=\"ltr\" style=\"line-height:1.2;margin-top:5pt;margin-bottom:5pt;\" role=\"presentation\"><span style=\"font-size: 11pt; background-color: transparent; font-variant-numeric: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; font-variant-alternates: normal; font-variant-position: normal; font-variant-emoji: normal; vertical-align: baseline; text-wrap-mode: wrap;\"><span style=\"font-family: var(--font-inter), Inter, sans-serif;\"><span style=\"font-size: 18px;\">Enterprise solutions: The metaverse will enable incremental improvements to today\'s enterprise solutions, as well as entirely new innovations. Notable categories include the following:</span></span></span></p></li></ol><p dir=\"ltr\" style=\"line-height:1.2;margin-top:5pt;margin-bottom:5pt;\"><span style=\"font-size: 11pt; background-color: transparent; font-variant-numeric: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; font-variant-alternates: normal; font-variant-position: normal; font-variant-emoji: normal; vertical-align: baseline;\"><span style=\"font-family: var(--font-inter), Inter, sans-serif;\"><span style=\"font-size: 18px;\">Improved remote collaboration: A gradual improvement will be the transition from 2-D screens to an immersive 3-D space, as online meetings in the metaverse will further enable remote work and potentially reduce the need for a shared location. As we move towards this transition, we expect to see a continuation of the pandemic-driven shift in how organizations are structured.</span></span></span></p><p dir=\"ltr\" style=\"line-height:1.2;margin-top:5pt;margin-bottom:5pt;\"><span style=\"font-size: 11pt; background-color: transparent; font-variant-numeric: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; font-variant-alternates: normal; font-variant-position: normal; font-variant-emoji: normal; vertical-align: baseline;\"><span style=\"font-family: var(--font-inter), Inter, sans-serif;\"><span style=\"font-size: 18px;\">Novel learning and development: Simulations of real-world environments and situations will enable a far more engaging learning process, opening up opportunities for both onboarding new colleagues and developing the current workforce, which is becoming increasingly important for companies competing for talent on a global scale.</span></span></span></p><p dir=\"ltr\" style=\"line-height:1.2;margin-left: 89.35pt;margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;\"><span style=\"font-size: 11pt; background-color: transparent; font-variant-numeric: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; font-variant-alternates: normal; font-variant-position: normal; font-variant-emoji: normal; vertical-align: baseline;\"><span style=\"font-family: var(--font-inter), Inter, sans-serif;\"><span style=\"font-size: 18px;\">Digital twins: We\'re also seeing new innovations like BMW\'s efforts to create a digital factory twin based on Nvidia Omniverse that aims to improve the efficiency of the entire supply chain. By building virtual replicas of physical environments and objects that generate data in real-time, far more comprehensive analyses can be created than before to enable better decision-making. The corporate agenda and major technology investments are likely to focus on those that increase productivity, such as automation and process visualization. Today, 50 percent of our work activities can be improved with these technologies. These include robotics, digital twins, and 3D or 4D printing.</span></span></span></p><div><span style=\"font-size: 11pt; background-color: transparent; font-variant-numeric: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; font-variant-alternates: normal; font-variant-position: normal; font-variant-emoji: normal; vertical-align: baseline;\"><br></span>\n</div></span></span></div></span>\n</div>',1,0,70,'2025-09-12 07:25:18','2025-10-08 10:37:37'),(231,36,'Possibilities of Metaverse Implementation','<div class=\"prose prose-lg max-w-none space-y-4\">\n\n<span id=\"docs-internal-guid-73d604d7-7fff-d4ab-1692-7ff9e65f954c\"><p dir=\"ltr\" style=\"line-height:1.2;margin-top:5pt;margin-bottom:5pt;\"><span style=\"font-size: 11pt; font-family: Poppins, sans-serif; color: rgb(0, 0, 0); background-color: transparent; font-variant-numeric: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; font-variant-alternates: normal; font-variant-position: normal; font-variant-emoji: normal; vertical-align: baseline; white-space-collapse: preserve;\"><span style=\"font-family: var(--font-inter), Inter, sans-serif;\"><span style=\"font-size: 18px;\">Looking ahead, executives see cryptocurrency, AI, and AR/VR as the top three opportunities in the metaverse technology space.</span></span></span></p><p dir=\"ltr\" style=\"line-height:1.2;margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;\"><span style=\"font-size: 11pt; font-family: Poppins, sans-serif; color: rgb(0, 0, 0); background-color: transparent; font-variant-numeric: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; font-variant-alternates: normal; font-variant-position: normal; font-variant-emoji: normal; vertical-align: baseline; white-space-collapse: preserve;\"><span style=\"font-family: var(--font-inter), Inter, sans-serif;\"><span style=\"font-size: 18px;\">Top 3 metaverse technologies, points-based ranking:\n\n</span></span></span></p><p dir=\"ltr\" style=\"line-height:1.2;margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;\"><span style=\"font-size:8pt;font-family:Poppins,sans-serif;color:#000000;background-color:transparent;font-weight:400;font-style:normal;font-variant:normal;text-decoration:none;vertical-align:baseline;white-space:pre;white-space:pre-wrap;\"><span style=\"font-family: var(--font-inter), Inter, sans-serif;\"><span style=\"font-size: 18px;\"><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\"><img src=\"https://ptgr-bucket.s3.us-east-1.amazonaws.com/chapter5/4.png\" alt=\"Image\" class=\"max-w-full h-auto rounded-lg my-4 cursor-move hover:ring-2 hover:ring-primary/50 transition-all\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" style=\"max-width: 100%; height: auto;\"><br></span></span></span></span></p><p dir=\"ltr\" style=\"line-height:1.2;margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;\"><span style=\"font-size:8pt;font-family:Poppins,sans-serif;color:#000000;background-color:transparent;font-weight:400;font-style:normal;font-variant:normal;text-decoration:none;vertical-align:baseline;white-space:pre;white-space:pre-wrap;\"><span style=\"font-family: var(--font-inter), Inter, sans-serif;\"><span style=\"font-size: 18px;\"><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">Figure 4: What do you think are the top three metaverse technologies for businesses in the future? (ranking of the top 3); Points ranking with 3 points for each technology in 1st place and  2 points for 2nd place, 1 point for 3rd place (n = 448).</span></span></span></span></p><p dir=\"ltr\" style=\"line-height:1.2;margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;\"><span style=\"font-size:8pt;font-family:Poppins,sans-serif;color:#000000;background-color:transparent;font-weight:400;font-style:normal;font-variant:normal;text-decoration:none;vertical-align:baseline;white-space:pre;white-space:pre-wrap;\"><span style=\"font-family: var(--font-inter), Inter, sans-serif;\"><span style=\"font-size: 18px;\"><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">(Source: McKinsey &amp; Company Senior Executives Survey, April 2022)</span></span></span></span></p><p dir=\"ltr\" style=\"line-height:1.2;margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;\"><span style=\"font-size: 11pt; font-family: Poppins, sans-serif; color: rgb(0, 0, 0); background-color: transparent; font-variant-numeric: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; font-variant-alternates: normal; font-variant-position: normal; font-variant-emoji: normal; vertical-align: baseline; white-space-collapse: preserve;\"><span id=\"docs-internal-guid-fe94b5e0-7fff-f37c-b434-7d7542dc929c\"></span></span></p><div><span style=\"font-size: 11pt; font-family: Poppins, sans-serif; color: rgb(0, 0, 0); background-color: transparent; font-variant-numeric: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; font-variant-alternates: normal; font-variant-position: normal; font-variant-emoji: normal; vertical-align: baseline; white-space-collapse: preserve;\"><span style=\"font-family: var(--font-inter), Inter, sans-serif;\"><span style=\"font-size: 18px;\"><br></span></span></span></div><div><span style=\"font-size: 11pt; font-family: Poppins, sans-serif; color: rgb(0, 0, 0); background-color: transparent; font-variant-numeric: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; font-variant-alternates: normal; font-variant-position: normal; font-variant-emoji: normal; vertical-align: baseline; white-space-collapse: preserve;\"><span style=\"font-family: var(--font-inter), Inter, sans-serif;\"><span style=\"font-size: 18px;\"><img src=\"https://ptgr-bucket.s3.us-east-1.amazonaws.com/chapter5/5.jpg\" alt=\"Image\" class=\"max-w-full h-auto rounded-lg my-4 cursor-move hover:ring-2 hover:ring-primary/50 transition-all\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" style=\"max-width: 100%; height: auto;\">\n</span></span><span id=\"docs-internal-guid-ecc7de17-7fff-291a-6010-262741f41e27\"><p dir=\"ltr\" style=\"line-height:1.2;margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;\"><span style=\"font-size: 8pt; background-color: transparent; font-variant-numeric: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; font-variant-alternates: normal; font-variant-position: normal; font-variant-emoji: normal; vertical-align: baseline;\"><span style=\"font-family: var(--font-inter), Inter, sans-serif;\"><span style=\"font-size: 18px;\"><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">Figure 5: What are the top three barriers for your business to adopt metaverse technology? The top 3 obstacles were ranked across industries based on the top 1 obstacle (n=448).</span></span></span></span></p><p dir=\"ltr\" style=\"line-height:1.2;margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;\"><span style=\"font-size: 8pt; background-color: transparent; font-variant-numeric: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; font-variant-alternates: normal; font-variant-position: normal; font-variant-emoji: normal; vertical-align: baseline;\"><span style=\"font-family: var(--font-inter), Inter, sans-serif;\"><span style=\"font-size: 18px;\"><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">The plan for creating core protocols, or the way in which monetary value is delivered, was mentioned.</span></span></span></span></p><p dir=\"ltr\" style=\"line-height:1.2;margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;\"><span style=\"font-size: 8pt; background-color: transparent; font-variant-numeric: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; font-variant-alternates: normal; font-variant-position: normal; font-variant-emoji: normal; vertical-align: baseline;\"><span style=\"font-family: var(--font-inter), Inter, sans-serif;\"><span style=\"font-size: 18px;\"><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">(Source: McKinsey &amp; Company Senior Executives Survey, April 2022)</span>\n\n</span></span></span></p><p dir=\"ltr\" style=\"line-height:1.2;margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;\"><span style=\"font-size: 8pt; background-color: transparent; font-variant-numeric: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; font-variant-alternates: normal; font-variant-position: normal; font-variant-emoji: normal; vertical-align: baseline;\"><span style=\"font-family: var(--font-inter), Inter, sans-serif;\"><span style=\"font-size: 18px;\"><img src=\"https://ptgr-bucket.s3.us-east-1.amazonaws.com/chapter5/6.jpg\" alt=\"Image\" class=\"max-w-full h-auto rounded-lg my-4 cursor-move hover:ring-2 hover:ring-primary/50 transition-all\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" style=\"max-width: 100%; height: auto;\"><br></span></span></span></p><p dir=\"ltr\" style=\"line-height:1.2;margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;\"><span style=\"font-size:8pt;font-family:Poppins,sans-serif;color:#000000;background-color:transparent;font-weight:400;font-style:normal;font-variant:normal;text-decoration:none;vertical-align:baseline;white-space:pre;white-space:pre-wrap;\"><span style=\"font-family: var(--font-inter), Inter, sans-serif;\"><span style=\"font-size: 18px;\"><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">Figure 6: By 2030, the metaverse could generate $4 trillion to $5 trillion in revenue in consumer and enterprise applications.</span></span></span></span></p><p dir=\"ltr\" style=\"line-height:1.2;margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;\"><span style=\"font-size:8pt;font-family:Poppins,sans-serif;color:#000000;background-color:transparent;font-weight:400;font-style:normal;font-variant:normal;text-decoration:none;vertical-align:baseline;white-space:pre;white-space:pre-wrap;\"><span style=\"font-family: var(--font-inter), Inter, sans-serif;\"><span style=\"font-size: 18px;\"><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">(Source: McKinsey analysis; a detailed explanation of the methodology underlying their size forecast)</span></span></span></span></p><p dir=\"ltr\" style=\"line-height:1.2;margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;\"><span style=\"font-size: 8pt; background-color: transparent; font-variant-numeric: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; font-variant-alternates: normal; font-variant-position: normal; font-variant-emoji: normal; vertical-align: baseline;\"><span id=\"docs-internal-guid-c59a40f3-7fff-acf4-2934-ba2353145125\"></span></span></p><p dir=\"ltr\" style=\"line-height:1.2;margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;\"><span style=\"font-size:8pt;font-family:Poppins,sans-serif;color:#000000;background-color:transparent;font-weight:400;font-style:normal;font-variant:normal;text-decoration:none;vertical-align:baseline;white-space:pre;white-space:pre-wrap;\"><span style=\"font-family: var(--font-inter), Inter, sans-serif;\"><span style=\"font-size: 18px;\"><br></span></span></span></p><p dir=\"ltr\" style=\"line-height:1.2;margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;\"><span style=\"font-size:8pt;font-family:Poppins,sans-serif;color:#000000;background-color:transparent;font-weight:400;font-style:normal;font-variant:normal;text-decoration:none;vertical-align:baseline;white-space:pre;white-space:pre-wrap;\"><span style=\"font-family: var(--font-inter), Inter, sans-serif;\"><span style=\"font-size: 18px;\"><br></span></span></span></p><p dir=\"ltr\" style=\"line-height:1.2;margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;\"><span style=\"font-size:8pt;font-family:Poppins,sans-serif;color:#000000;background-color:transparent;font-weight:400;font-style:normal;font-variant:normal;text-decoration:none;vertical-align:baseline;white-space:pre;white-space:pre-wrap;\"><span style=\"font-family: var(--font-inter), Inter, sans-serif;\"><span style=\"font-size: 18px;\"><img src=\"https://ptgr-bucket.s3.us-east-1.amazonaws.com/chapter5/7.jpg\" alt=\"Image\" class=\"max-w-full h-auto rounded-lg my-4 cursor-move hover:ring-2 hover:ring-primary/50 transition-all\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" style=\"max-width: 100%; height: auto;\">\n<span style=\"font-size: 10px;\"><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">Figure 7: 1XR: Augmented Reality - Virtual Reality (VR) and Augmented Reality (AR).</span></span></span></span></span></p><p dir=\"ltr\" style=\"line-height:1.2;margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;\"><span style=\"font-size:8pt;font-family:Poppins,sans-serif;color:#000000;background-color:transparent;font-weight:400;font-style:normal;font-variant:normal;text-decoration:none;vertical-align:baseline;white-space:pre;white-space:pre-wrap;\"><span style=\"font-family: var(--font-inter), Inter, sans-serif;\"><span style=\"font-size: 18px;\"><span style=\"font-size: 10px;\"><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">(Source: Expert surveys, McKinsey analysis)</span></span>\n\n</span></span></span></p><p dir=\"ltr\" style=\"line-height:1.2;margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;\"><span style=\"font-size:11pt;font-family:Poppins,sans-serif;color:#000000;background-color:transparent;font-weight:400;font-style:normal;font-variant:normal;text-decoration:none;vertical-align:baseline;white-space:pre;white-space:pre-wrap;\"><span style=\"font-family: var(--font-inter), Inter, sans-serif;\"><span style=\"font-size: 18px;\">Apparel, fashion, and luxury Shoppers already spend much of their day in front of digital screens and intend to spend most of their day in the metaverse over the next five years. [1] Will they also buy and wear fashion there? The signs are promising. Decentraland\'s Metaverse Fashion Week in March received far more attention in the industry than any other digital fashion event before it, attracting a variety of brands and creatives, including Dolce &amp; Gabbana, Estée Lauder, and Etro, although some notable metaverse players such as Gucci and Ralph Lauren did not attend. The experience was blockchain-based and was created on \"land\" and sold as NFTs, with digital fashion bought and worn as NFTs. [2] It also underlined the extent to which the sector has developed. In 2000, some believed that e-commerce could never be a luxury experience, but today there is an understanding that digitization can lead to a better customer experience. If luxury is about being part of a community, the metaverse has the potential to improve that. \"Probably underestimating the value that people have when they want to express themselves in a virtual world with a virtual product and persona,\" said Robert Triefus, executive vice president and chief marketing officer of Gucci, in our recent State of Fashion 2022 report. Due to the fashion industry\'s ability to be both virtual and physical, we believe it will be at the forefront of the metaverse. Many brands are already taking advantage of the opportunity to launch virtual clothing to take advantage of their customers\' growing appetite for creating digital identities.</span></span></span></p><p dir=\"ltr\" style=\"line-height:1.2;margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;\"><span style=\"font-size: 8pt; background-color: transparent; font-variant-numeric: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; font-variant-alternates: normal; font-variant-position: normal; font-variant-emoji: normal; vertical-align: baseline;\"><span id=\"docs-internal-guid-5fe15546-7fff-06f4-1668-617e4a714dfe\"></span></span></p><div><span style=\"font-size: 8pt; background-color: transparent; font-variant-numeric: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; font-variant-alternates: normal; font-variant-position: normal; font-variant-emoji: normal; vertical-align: baseline;\"><br></span>\n</div></span></span></div></span>\n</div>',1,0,70,'2025-09-12 07:34:04','2025-10-08 10:40:58'),(232,36,'What Could Come Next?','<div class=\"prose prose-lg max-w-none space-y-4\">\n\n<span id=\"docs-internal-guid-9d17b75f-7fff-f425-76d8-1c69e06b5446\"><p dir=\"ltr\" style=\"line-height:1.2;margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;\"><span style=\"font-size: 11pt; font-family: Poppins, sans-serif; color: rgb(0, 0, 0); background-color: transparent; font-variant-numeric: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; font-variant-alternates: normal; font-variant-position: normal; font-variant-emoji: normal; vertical-align: baseline; white-space-collapse: preserve;\"><span style=\"font-size: 18px;\"><span style=\"font-family: var(--font-inter), Inter, sans-serif;\">Creating their own platforms and virtual worlds—with the risk of further fragmentation and interoperability issues—could be the next step for fashion and luxury brands in the metaverse. So far, companies have held back and chosen less resource-intensive ways to enter this area. An exception is purely virtual established companies such as Fabricant, which has already partnered with various clothing companies such as Adidas, Under Armour, and Tommy Hilfiger. (Yotka, 2021) Another virtual fashion startup, DressX has more than 100 designers and 1,000 items created and has partnered with well-known fashion brands such as H&amp;M. As mentioned earlier, luxury brands are developing immersive virtual spaces—like Australian designer Daniel Avakian. Customers can visit a boutique in a virtual representation of its New York store regardless of where they are, while employees can work in the metaverse as well as at the physical locations—if one is quiet, they can take care of the other. (LaFrenz &amp; Sier, 2022) This is an early example of the kind of new experiences that can be developed. However, there are also significant challenges. While pioneers have shown that the metaverse offers opportunities that are similar to or even improve on those in the real world, the potential remains unclear—and most companies are proceeding cautiously. There are also concerns about brand dilution, especially in the luxury space, as companies think about the association with digital products and how this could distract their image from the core position of the luxury brand. Another consideration is the maturity of AR/VR technology, where faulty applications can undermine the user experience of luxury goods, posing a threat to image and customer loyalty. Brands should consider what it takes to find the right balance between testing and learning and make sure they thoroughly think through the potential outcomes of actions taken in this new, exciting, and seemingly limitless space. There is also the question of what a metaverse project means organizationally. Generating sustainable revenue from virtual worlds will require entirely new skills and an almost diametrical talent shift in the creative design process as well as digital execution. However, the level of connectivity in the metaverse for certain users already shows how the virtual world could have a significant impact on consumer habits and trends in the physical world, not to mention how it affects which physical designs are ultimately produced and sold (Maguire, 2022).</span></span></span></p><br><br><p dir=\"ltr\" style=\"line-height:2;background-color:#ffffff;margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;\"><br></p></span>\n</div>',1,1,70,'2025-09-12 07:35:19','2025-10-08 11:36:20'),(233,37,'Key takeaways on NFTs','<div class=\"prose prose-lg max-w-none space-y-4\">\n\n<span id=\"docs-internal-guid-69288955-7fff-bf4e-5d5a-664007b38963\"><p dir=\"ltr\" style=\"line-height:1.2;margin-top:5pt;margin-bottom:5pt;\"><span style=\"font-size: 11pt; font-family: Poppins, sans-serif; color: rgb(0, 0, 0); background-color: transparent; font-variant-numeric: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; font-variant-alternates: normal; font-variant-position: normal; font-variant-emoji: normal; vertical-align: baseline; white-space-collapse: preserve;\"><span style=\"font-size: 18px;\"><span style=\"font-family: var(--font-inter), Inter, sans-serif;\">Non-fungible tokens (NFTs) combine the best features of decentralized blockchain technology with non-fungible assets to create provably unique, provably scarce, and provably authentic tokens using blockchain technology. NFTs can be used in a variety of use cases, including collectibles, games, art, virtual assets, and the tokenization of real-world assets. They also offer a flexible way to store, control, and protect information about one\'s identity. Non-fungible tokens have a long history, built on the Bitcoin network since 2012 with the introduction of colored coins. On Ethereum, the first NFT was the CryptoPunks in 2017, followed shortly after by the CryptoKitties, the most successful and well-known early NFT project ever. During the Ethereum boom in late 2017 and early 2018, NFT activity in CryptoKitties led to a huge increase in activity. However, when the market crashed in 2018, interest in NFTs was also affected and stagnated until the end of 2020, when NFTs experienced a renewed surge. Despite their advantages, the adoption of NFTs is still low compared to the tens of millions of people who own cryptocurrencies worldwide. The obstacles that stand in the way of mass adoption of NFTs are inaccessibility, the novelty of the technology, the volatility of transaction fees, the difficulty of linking real-world assets to NFTs, and regulation.</span></span></span></p><p dir=\"ltr\" style=\"line-height:1.2;margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;\"><span style=\"font-size: 11pt; font-family: Poppins, sans-serif; color: rgb(0, 0, 0); background-color: transparent; font-weight: 700; font-variant-numeric: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; font-variant-alternates: normal; font-variant-position: normal; font-variant-emoji: normal; vertical-align: baseline; white-space-collapse: preserve;\"><span style=\"font-size: 18px;\"><span style=\"font-family: var(--font-inter), Inter, sans-serif;\">What is fungibility?</span></span></span></p><p dir=\"ltr\" style=\"line-height:1.2;margin-top:5pt;margin-bottom:5pt;\"><span style=\"font-size: 11pt; font-family: Poppins, sans-serif; color: rgb(0, 0, 0); background-color: transparent; font-variant-numeric: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; font-variant-alternates: normal; font-variant-position: normal; font-variant-emoji: normal; vertical-align: baseline; white-space-collapse: preserve;\"><span style=\"font-size: 18px;\"><span style=\"font-family: var(--font-inter), Inter, sans-serif;\">Before we dive into the intricacies of NFTs, it\'s worth taking a look at the difference between \"fungible\" and \"non-fungible.\" A fungible item or token is interchangeable with another unit of the same item in all respects. For example, one Bitcoin is equal to another Bitcoin, just as one US dollar is equivalent to another US dollar. If you lend your friend a $10 bill, you don\'t have to pay the loan back with the same $10 bill—any $10 bill will do. Non-fungible items, on the other hand, are not interchangeable with each other and have unique properties that can radically differentiate them from each other, even though they may look similar.</span></span></span></p><p dir=\"ltr\" style=\"line-height:1.2;margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;\"><span style=\"font-size: 11pt; font-family: Poppins, sans-serif; color: rgb(0, 0, 0); background-color: transparent; font-weight: 700; font-variant-numeric: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; font-variant-alternates: normal; font-variant-position: normal; font-variant-emoji: normal; vertical-align: baseline; white-space-collapse: preserve;\"><span style=\"font-size: 18px;\"><span style=\"font-family: var(--font-inter), Inter, sans-serif;\">What is a non-fungible token (NFT)?</span></span></span></p><p dir=\"ltr\" style=\"line-height:1.2;margin-top:5pt;margin-bottom:5pt;\"><span style=\"font-size: 11pt; font-family: Poppins, sans-serif; color: rgb(0, 0, 0); background-color: transparent; font-variant-numeric: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; font-variant-alternates: normal; font-variant-position: normal; font-variant-emoji: normal; vertical-align: baseline; white-space-collapse: preserve;\"><span style=\"font-size: 18px;\"><span style=\"font-family: var(--font-inter), Inter, sans-serif;\">A non-fungible token (NFT) is a unique cryptographic asset used to create and authenticate ownership of digital assets. NFTs are used for cartoons, music, film and video clips, JPEGs, postcards, sports trading cards, virtual real estate, and pets. NFTs provide a secure record that comes with a unique identification code that is stored on the blockchain: Unlike stocks, bonds, and other traditional investments, NFTs are considered an alternative investment that is not fungible or replaceable by a similar object. NFTs are comparable to rare collectibles. The demand for them increased in 2020 and increased drastically in 2021. This drove the prices of digital artwork up, and celebrities, content creators, auction houses, and others got involved in the market.</span></span></span></p><p dir=\"ltr\" style=\"line-height:1.2;margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;\"><span style=\"font-size: 11pt; font-family: Poppins, sans-serif; color: rgb(0, 0, 0); background-color: transparent; font-variant-numeric: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; font-variant-alternates: normal; font-variant-position: normal; font-variant-emoji: normal; vertical-align: baseline; white-space-collapse: preserve;\"><span style=\"font-size: 18px;\"><span style=\"font-family: var(--font-inter), Inter, sans-serif;\">NFTs can be used to represent ownership of digital art or other unique digital items, the ownership of which is recorded in smart contracts on a blockchain. NFTs are tokens stored on a blockchain that can be used to represent ownership of digital assets such as artwork, recordings, virtual real estate, and pets. NFTs are sold on dedicated marketplaces such as OpenSea, Axie Marketplace, and Rarible. These platforms also allow investors to swap ownership of the asset underlying the NFT. And because NFTs use smart contract technology, they can be set up so that the original artist can earn a percentage of all subsequent sales (Putnings, 2022).</span></span></span></p><p dir=\"ltr\" style=\"line-height:1.2;margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;\"><span style=\"font-size: 11pt; font-family: Poppins, sans-serif; color: rgb(0, 0, 0); background-color: transparent; font-weight: 700; font-variant-numeric: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; font-variant-alternates: normal; font-variant-position: normal; font-variant-emoji: normal; vertical-align: baseline; white-space-collapse: preserve;\"><span style=\"font-size: 18px;\"><span style=\"font-family: var(--font-inter), Inter, sans-serif;\">Applications:</span></span></span></p><p dir=\"ltr\" style=\"line-height:1.2;margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;\"><span style=\"font-size: 11pt; font-family: Poppins, sans-serif; color: rgb(0, 0, 0); background-color: transparent; font-variant-numeric: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; font-variant-alternates: normal; font-variant-position: normal; font-variant-emoji: normal; vertical-align: baseline; white-space-collapse: preserve;\"><span style=\"font-size: 18px;\"><span style=\"font-family: var(--font-inter), Inter, sans-serif;\">As you can imagine, NFTs are extremely powerful, as they can represent literally any asset, digital or real. The following are just a few use cases for NFTs:</span></span></span></p><div><span style=\"font-size: 11pt; font-family: Poppins, sans-serif; color: rgb(0, 0, 0); background-color: transparent; font-variant-numeric: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; font-variant-alternates: normal; font-variant-position: normal; font-variant-emoji: normal; vertical-align: baseline; white-space-collapse: preserve;\"><span style=\"font-size: 18px;\"><span style=\"font-family: var(--font-inter), Inter, sans-serif;\"><br></span></span></span></div><div><span style=\"font-size: 11pt; font-family: Poppins, sans-serif; color: rgb(0, 0, 0); background-color: transparent; font-variant-numeric: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; font-variant-alternates: normal; font-variant-position: normal; font-variant-emoji: normal; vertical-align: baseline; white-space-collapse: preserve;\"><span style=\"font-size: 18px;\"><span style=\"font-family: var(--font-inter), Inter, sans-serif;\"><img src=\"https://ptgr-bucket.s3.us-east-1.amazonaws.com/chapter5/8.jpg\" alt=\"Image\" class=\"max-w-full h-auto rounded-lg my-4 cursor-move hover:ring-2 hover:ring-primary/50 transition-all\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" style=\"max-width: 100%; height: auto;\">\n</span></span><span id=\"docs-internal-guid-4f8d9548-7fff-ead7-b08d-ca927a05189d\"><p dir=\"ltr\" style=\"line-height:1.2;margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;\"><span style=\"font-size: 8pt; background-color: transparent; font-variant-numeric: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; font-variant-alternates: normal; font-variant-position: normal; font-variant-emoji: normal; vertical-align: baseline;\"><span style=\"font-size: 18px;\"><span style=\"font-family: var(--font-inter), Inter, sans-serif;\">Figure 1: Areas of application of NFTs</span></span></span></p><p dir=\"ltr\" style=\"line-height:1.2;margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;\"><span style=\"font-size: 8pt; background-color: transparent; font-variant-numeric: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; font-variant-alternates: normal; font-variant-position: normal; font-variant-emoji: normal; vertical-align: baseline;\"><span style=\"font-size: 18px;\"><span style=\"font-family: var(--font-inter), Inter, sans-serif;\">(Source: Crypto.com)</span></span></span></p><div><span style=\"font-size: 8pt; background-color: transparent; font-variant-numeric: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; font-variant-alternates: normal; font-variant-position: normal; font-variant-emoji: normal; vertical-align: baseline;\"><br></span>\n</div></span></span></div></span>\n</div>',1,0,70,'2025-09-12 07:36:55','2025-10-08 11:37:22'),(234,37,'The Technology Behind NFT','<div class=\"prose prose-lg max-w-none space-y-4\">\n\n<span id=\"docs-internal-guid-d6b454a6-7fff-939e-a70f-40838a673eb9\"><p dir=\"ltr\" style=\"line-height:1.2;margin-top:5pt;margin-bottom:5pt;\"><span style=\"font-size: 11pt; font-family: Poppins, sans-serif; color: rgb(0, 0, 0); background-color: transparent; font-variant-numeric: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; font-variant-alternates: normal; font-variant-position: normal; font-variant-emoji: normal; vertical-align: baseline; white-space-collapse: preserve;\"><span style=\"font-size: 18px;\"><span style=\"font-family: var(--font-inter), Inter, sans-serif;\">Blockchain technology establishes the ownership of the NFT. Blockchain acts as a decentralized ledger and enables public authentication of NFTs. The technology uses a digital signature to prove who the owner of the work is and that it is an original. An NFT buyer does not own a piece of art to hang on the wall but a digital image of that artwork and a digital authentication certificate. The NFT buyer does not own the copyright or trademark of the object. Even though there are numerous versions of it on the internet, NFT buyers own an original in the virtual world. Royalties can be programmed into the tokens so that artists can earn a portion of the revenue in the future.</span></span></span></p><p dir=\"ltr\" style=\"line-height:1.2;margin-top:5pt;margin-bottom:5pt;\"><span style=\"font-size: 11pt; font-family: Poppins, sans-serif; color: rgb(0, 0, 0); background-color: transparent; font-variant-numeric: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; font-variant-alternates: normal; font-variant-position: normal; font-variant-emoji: normal; vertical-align: baseline; white-space-collapse: preserve;\"><span style=\"font-size: 18px;\"><span style=\"font-family: var(--font-inter), Inter, sans-serif;\">Qualities and features of NFTs:</span></span></span></p><ol style=\"padding-inline-start: 48px;\"><li dir=\"ltr\" style=\"list-style-type: decimal; font-size: 11pt; font-family: Poppins, sans-serif; color: rgb(0, 0, 0); background-color: transparent; font-variant-numeric: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; font-variant-alternates: normal; font-variant-position: normal; font-variant-emoji: normal; vertical-align: baseline; white-space: pre; margin-left: 77.35pt;\" aria-level=\"1\"><p dir=\"ltr\" style=\"line-height:1.2;margin-top:5pt;margin-bottom:5pt;\" role=\"presentation\"><span style=\"font-size: 11pt; background-color: transparent; font-variant-numeric: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; font-variant-alternates: normal; font-variant-position: normal; font-variant-emoji: normal; vertical-align: baseline; text-wrap-mode: wrap;\"><span style=\"font-size: 18px;\"><span style=\"font-family: var(--font-inter), Inter, sans-serif;\">Due to their uniqueness, NFTs are not counterfeitable, meaning they are not interchangeable.</span></span></span></p></li><li dir=\"ltr\" style=\"list-style-type: decimal; font-size: 11pt; font-family: Poppins, sans-serif; color: rgb(0, 0, 0); background-color: transparent; font-variant-numeric: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; font-variant-alternates: normal; font-variant-position: normal; font-variant-emoji: normal; vertical-align: baseline; white-space: pre; margin-left: 77.35pt;\" aria-level=\"1\"><p dir=\"ltr\" style=\"line-height:1.2;margin-top:5pt;margin-bottom:5pt;\" role=\"presentation\"><span style=\"font-size: 11pt; background-color: transparent; font-variant-numeric: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; font-variant-alternates: normal; font-variant-position: normal; font-variant-emoji: normal; vertical-align: baseline; text-wrap-mode: wrap;\"><span style=\"font-size: 18px;\"><span style=\"font-family: var(--font-inter), Inter, sans-serif;\">NFTs are generally not divisible. The basic unit of the NFT is the token, which usually cannot be divided into smaller denominations, just as a dollar can be divided into 10 dimes. However, some platforms, such as Fractional, have recently introduced the splitability of NFTs. Fractional ownership makes it possible to divide an NFT into smaller NFTs that can be sold to multiple buyers.</span></span></span></p></li><li dir=\"ltr\" style=\"list-style-type: decimal; font-size: 11pt; font-family: Poppins, sans-serif; color: rgb(0, 0, 0); background-color: transparent; font-variant-numeric: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; font-variant-alternates: normal; font-variant-position: normal; font-variant-emoji: normal; vertical-align: baseline; white-space: pre; margin-left: 77.35pt;\" aria-level=\"1\"><p dir=\"ltr\" style=\"line-height:1.2;margin-top:5pt;margin-bottom:5pt;\" role=\"presentation\"><span style=\"font-size: 11pt; background-color: transparent; font-variant-numeric: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; font-variant-alternates: normal; font-variant-position: normal; font-variant-emoji: normal; vertical-align: baseline; text-wrap-mode: wrap;\"><span style=\"font-size: 18px;\"><span style=\"font-family: var(--font-inter), Inter, sans-serif;\">Also, NFTs are immutable. They cannot be altered once they have been encoded using blockchain technology. The originality and legitimacy of the item are validated by the blockchain in which it is stored.</span></span></span></p></li></ol><p dir=\"ltr\" style=\"line-height:1.2;margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;\"><span style=\"font-size: 11pt; font-family: Poppins, sans-serif; color: rgb(0, 0, 0); background-color: transparent; font-weight: 700; font-variant-numeric: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; font-variant-alternates: normal; font-variant-position: normal; font-variant-emoji: normal; vertical-align: baseline; white-space-collapse: preserve;\"><span style=\"font-size: 18px;\"><span style=\"font-family: var(--font-inter), Inter, sans-serif;\">Why are NFTs important?</span></span></span></p><p dir=\"ltr\" style=\"line-height:1.2;margin-top:5pt;margin-bottom:5pt;\"><span style=\"font-size: 11pt; font-family: Poppins, sans-serif; color: rgb(0, 0, 0); background-color: transparent; font-variant-numeric: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; font-variant-alternates: normal; font-variant-position: normal; font-variant-emoji: normal; vertical-align: baseline; white-space-collapse: preserve;\"><span style=\"font-size: 18px;\"><span style=\"font-family: var(--font-inter), Inter, sans-serif;\">NFTs allow individuals to buy and sell digital goods in new ways. They help artists and other content creators digitally showcase their skills and provide the ability to securely appraise, buy, and trade digital art using a digital ledger. NFTs allow new and previously decentralized players to develop innovative value exchanges to build new market structures. NFTs are a significant form of alternative investment that appeals to buyers\' personal interests and passions. NFTs allow retail investors to invest in things they have a personal relationship with, as well as things that offer financial and useful value. The NFT buyer hopes that the token\'s value will increase over time, similar to all investments. Like their fungible relatives, NFTs are subject to fluctuations in supply and demand. According to data from Grand View Research, the NFT market was valued at $20.44 billion in 2022 and is expected to grow to $211.72 billion by 2030.</span></span></span></p><p dir=\"ltr\" style=\"line-height:1.2;margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;\"><span style=\"font-size: 11pt; font-family: Poppins, sans-serif; color: rgb(0, 0, 0); background-color: transparent; font-weight: 700; font-variant-numeric: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; font-variant-alternates: normal; font-variant-position: normal; font-variant-emoji: normal; vertical-align: baseline; white-space-collapse: preserve;\"><span style=\"font-size: 18px;\"><span style=\"font-family: var(--font-inter), Inter, sans-serif;\">Advantages of NFTs</span></span></span></p><p dir=\"ltr\" style=\"line-height:1.2;margin-top:5pt;margin-bottom:5pt;\"><span style=\"font-size: 11pt; font-family: Poppins, sans-serif; color: rgb(0, 0, 0); background-color: transparent; font-variant-numeric: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; font-variant-alternates: normal; font-variant-position: normal; font-variant-emoji: normal; vertical-align: baseline; white-space-collapse: preserve;\"><span style=\"font-size: 18px;\"><span style=\"font-family: var(--font-inter), Inter, sans-serif;\">NFTs bring various advantages to digital artists, other creators, and collectors. Some of the key benefits include the following:</span></span></span></p><ul style=\"padding-inline-start: 48px;\"><li dir=\"ltr\" style=\"list-style-type: disc; font-size: 9pt; font-family: Poppins, sans-serif; color: rgb(0, 0, 0); background-color: transparent; font-variant-numeric: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; font-variant-alternates: normal; font-variant-position: normal; font-variant-emoji: normal; vertical-align: baseline; white-space: pre; margin-left: 77.35pt;\" aria-level=\"1\"><p dir=\"ltr\" style=\"line-height:1.2;margin-top:5pt;margin-bottom:5pt;\" role=\"presentation\"><span style=\"font-size: 11pt; background-color: transparent; font-variant-numeric: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; font-variant-alternates: normal; font-variant-position: normal; font-variant-emoji: normal; vertical-align: baseline; text-wrap-mode: wrap;\"><span style=\"font-size: 18px;\"><span style=\"font-family: var(--font-inter), Inter, sans-serif;\">Direct monetization. NFTs allow digital artists to monetize their works by selling them on online marketplaces like Niio, without the need for galleries, auction houses, or other middlemen.</span></span></span></p></li><li dir=\"ltr\" style=\"list-style-type: disc; font-size: 9pt; font-family: Poppins, sans-serif; color: rgb(0, 0, 0); background-color: transparent; font-variant-numeric: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; font-variant-alternates: normal; font-variant-position: normal; font-variant-emoji: normal; vertical-align: baseline; white-space: pre; margin-left: 77.35pt;\" aria-level=\"1\"><p dir=\"ltr\" style=\"line-height:1.2;margin-top:5pt;margin-bottom:5pt;\" role=\"presentation\"><span style=\"font-size: 11pt; background-color: transparent; font-variant-numeric: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; font-variant-alternates: normal; font-variant-position: normal; font-variant-emoji: normal; vertical-align: baseline; text-wrap-mode: wrap;\"><span style=\"font-size: 18px;\"><span style=\"font-family: var(--font-inter), Inter, sans-serif;\">Immutable ownership and authenticity. NFTs allow owners to prove the immutable ownership and authenticity of a digital asset. Unique NFT metadata verifies provenance, ownership, and transaction history. This ensures that ownership of an NFT can be easily verified and authenticated through blockchain technology, giving owners a sense of security and trust.</span></span></span></p></li><li dir=\"ltr\" style=\"list-style-type: disc; font-size: 9pt; font-family: Poppins, sans-serif; color: rgb(0, 0, 0); background-color: transparent; font-variant-numeric: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; font-variant-alternates: normal; font-variant-position: normal; font-variant-emoji: normal; vertical-align: baseline; white-space: pre; margin-left: 77.35pt;\" aria-level=\"1\"><p dir=\"ltr\" style=\"line-height:1.2;margin-top:5pt;margin-bottom:5pt;\" role=\"presentation\"><span style=\"font-size: 11pt; background-color: transparent; font-variant-numeric: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; font-variant-alternates: normal; font-variant-position: normal; font-variant-emoji: normal; vertical-align: baseline; text-wrap-mode: wrap;\"><span style=\"font-size: 18px;\"><span style=\"font-family: var(--font-inter), Inter, sans-serif;\">Royalties. NFTs allow artists to program royalties into their works so that they receive a percentage of future sales when they are resold on secondary markets. In this way, artists can benefit from the increasing value of their works even after the first sale. In addition, the royalties serve as an incentive for collectors to support artists and contribute to the overall growth of the NFT ecosystem.</span></span></span></p></li><li dir=\"ltr\" style=\"list-style-type: disc; font-size: 9pt; font-family: Poppins, sans-serif; color: rgb(0, 0, 0); background-color: transparent; font-variant-numeric: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; font-variant-alternates: normal; font-variant-position: normal; font-variant-emoji: normal; vertical-align: baseline; white-space: pre; margin-left: 77.35pt;\" aria-level=\"1\"><p dir=\"ltr\" style=\"line-height:1.2;margin-top:5pt;margin-bottom:5pt;\" role=\"presentation\"><span style=\"font-size: 11pt; background-color: transparent; font-variant-numeric: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; font-variant-alternates: normal; font-variant-position: normal; font-variant-emoji: normal; vertical-align: baseline; text-wrap-mode: wrap;\"><span style=\"font-size: 18px;\"><span style=\"font-family: var(--font-inter), Inter, sans-serif;\">Fractional ownership and accessible investing. NFTs allow for fractional ownership, allowing multiple people to jointly own a digital asset. Fractional ownership allows for broader participation and investment in high-value assets, providing access to individual collectors who might not otherwise be able to afford NFTs. This democratization of ownership expands the possibilities for both artists and collectors in the NFT space.</span></span></span></p></li><li dir=\"ltr\" style=\"list-style-type: disc; font-size: 9pt; font-family: Poppins, sans-serif; color: rgb(0, 0, 0); background-color: transparent; font-variant-numeric: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; font-variant-alternates: normal; font-variant-position: normal; font-variant-emoji: normal; vertical-align: baseline; white-space: pre; margin-left: 77.35pt;\" aria-level=\"1\"><p dir=\"ltr\" style=\"line-height:1.2;margin-top:5pt;margin-bottom:5pt;\" role=\"presentation\"><span style=\"font-size: 11pt; background-color: transparent; font-variant-numeric: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; font-variant-alternates: normal; font-variant-position: normal; font-variant-emoji: normal; vertical-align: baseline; text-wrap-mode: wrap;\"><span style=\"font-size: 18px;\"><span style=\"font-family: var(--font-inter), Inter, sans-serif;\">Improved interaction and usability. NFTs can go beyond static digital files and include interactive elements that provide collectors with a unique and immersive experience. For example, some NFTs grant access to exclusive events, experiences, or digital items or content related to the artwork or collectible. This can help build customer loyalty.</span></span></span></p></li></ul></span>\n\n</div>',1,0,70,'2025-09-12 07:39:57','2025-10-08 11:37:49'),(235,37,'What are uses and examples of uses for NFTs?','<div class=\"prose prose-lg max-w-none space-y-4\">\n\n<span id=\"docs-internal-guid-cdcfd514-7fff-4d8a-2b50-a40a0b16bec9\"><p dir=\"ltr\" style=\"line-height:1.2;margin-top:5pt;margin-bottom:5pt;\"><span style=\"font-size: 11pt; font-family: Poppins, sans-serif; color: rgb(0, 0, 0); background-color: transparent; font-variant-numeric: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; font-variant-alternates: normal; font-variant-position: normal; font-variant-emoji: normal; vertical-align: baseline; white-space-collapse: preserve;\"><span style=\"font-size: 18px;\"><span style=\"font-family: var(--font-inter), Inter, sans-serif;\">An early use of NFTs was a game launched in 2017 called CryptoKitties, which allowed users to trade and sell virtual kittens. In 2021, NFTs caused a stir, including Twitter CEO Jack Dorsey\'s first-ever tweet and the work of Beeple, the stage name of artist Mike Winkelmann, who sold his work \"Everydays: the First 5000 Days\" for $69 million.</span></span></span></p><p dir=\"ltr\" style=\"line-height:1.2;margin-top:5pt;margin-bottom:5pt;\"><span style=\"font-size: 11pt; font-family: Poppins, sans-serif; color: rgb(0, 0, 0); background-color: transparent; font-variant-numeric: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; font-variant-alternates: normal; font-variant-position: normal; font-variant-emoji: normal; vertical-align: baseline; white-space-collapse: preserve;\"><span style=\"font-size: 18px;\"><span style=\"font-family: var(--font-inter), Inter, sans-serif;\">NFTs are used to sell a range of virtual collectibles and assets, including the following:</span></span></span></p><ul style=\"padding-inline-start: 48px;\"><li dir=\"ltr\" style=\"list-style-type: disc; font-size: 9pt; font-family: Poppins, sans-serif; color: rgb(0, 0, 0); background-color: transparent; font-variant-numeric: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; font-variant-alternates: normal; font-variant-position: normal; font-variant-emoji: normal; vertical-align: baseline; white-space: pre; margin-left: 18pt; padding-left: 41.35pt;\" aria-level=\"1\"><p dir=\"ltr\" style=\"line-height:1.2;margin-top:5pt;margin-bottom:5pt;\" role=\"presentation\"><span style=\"font-size: 11pt; background-color: transparent; font-variant-numeric: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; font-variant-alternates: normal; font-variant-position: normal; font-variant-emoji: normal; vertical-align: baseline; text-wrap-mode: wrap;\"><span style=\"font-size: 18px;\"><span style=\"font-family: var(--font-inter), Inter, sans-serif;\">National Basketball Association Virtual Trading Cards.</span></span></span></p></li><li dir=\"ltr\" style=\"list-style-type: disc; font-size: 9pt; font-family: Poppins, sans-serif; color: rgb(0, 0, 0); background-color: transparent; font-variant-numeric: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; font-variant-alternates: normal; font-variant-position: normal; font-variant-emoji: normal; vertical-align: baseline; white-space: pre; margin-left: 18pt; padding-left: 41.35pt;\" aria-level=\"1\"><p dir=\"ltr\" style=\"line-height:1.2;margin-top:5pt;margin-bottom:5pt;\" role=\"presentation\"><span style=\"font-size: 11pt; background-color: transparent; font-variant-numeric: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; font-variant-alternates: normal; font-variant-position: normal; font-variant-emoji: normal; vertical-align: baseline; text-wrap-mode: wrap;\"><span style=\"font-size: 18px;\"><span style=\"font-family: var(--font-inter), Inter, sans-serif;\">Digital sneakers from Nike.</span></span></span></p></li><li dir=\"ltr\" style=\"list-style-type: disc; font-size: 9pt; font-family: Poppins, sans-serif; color: rgb(0, 0, 0); background-color: transparent; font-variant-numeric: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; font-variant-alternates: normal; font-variant-position: normal; font-variant-emoji: normal; vertical-align: baseline; white-space: pre; margin-left: 18pt; padding-left: 41.35pt;\" aria-level=\"1\"><p dir=\"ltr\" style=\"line-height:1.2;margin-top:5pt;margin-bottom:5pt;\" role=\"presentation\"><span style=\"font-size: 11pt; background-color: transparent; font-variant-numeric: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; font-variant-alternates: normal; font-variant-position: normal; font-variant-emoji: normal; vertical-align: baseline; text-wrap-mode: wrap;\"><span style=\"font-size: 18px;\"><span style=\"font-family: var(--font-inter), Inter, sans-serif;\">Trading cards with personal memorabilia of actor William Shatner.</span></span></span></p></li><li dir=\"ltr\" style=\"list-style-type: disc; font-size: 9pt; font-family: Poppins, sans-serif; color: rgb(0, 0, 0); background-color: transparent; font-variant-numeric: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; font-variant-alternates: normal; font-variant-position: normal; font-variant-emoji: normal; vertical-align: baseline; white-space: pre; margin-left: 18pt; padding-left: 41.35pt;\" aria-level=\"1\"><p dir=\"ltr\" style=\"line-height:1.2;margin-top:5pt;margin-bottom:5pt;\" role=\"presentation\"><span style=\"font-size: 11pt; background-color: transparent; font-variant-numeric: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; font-variant-alternates: normal; font-variant-position: normal; font-variant-emoji: normal; vertical-align: baseline; text-wrap-mode: wrap;\"><span style=\"font-size: 18px;\"><span style=\"font-family: var(--font-inter), Inter, sans-serif;\">A complete studio album by the rock band Kings of Leon.</span></span></span></p></li><li dir=\"ltr\" style=\"list-style-type: disc; font-size: 9pt; font-family: Poppins, sans-serif; color: rgb(0, 0, 0); background-color: transparent; font-variant-numeric: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; font-variant-alternates: normal; font-variant-position: normal; font-variant-emoji: normal; vertical-align: baseline; white-space: pre; margin-left: 18pt; padding-left: 41.35pt;\" aria-level=\"1\"><p dir=\"ltr\" style=\"line-height:1.2;margin-top:5pt;margin-bottom:5pt;\" role=\"presentation\"><span style=\"font-size: 11pt; background-color: transparent; font-variant-numeric: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; font-variant-alternates: normal; font-variant-position: normal; font-variant-emoji: normal; vertical-align: baseline; text-wrap-mode: wrap;\"><span style=\"font-size: 18px;\"><span style=\"font-family: var(--font-inter), Inter, sans-serif;\">The original Nyan Cat meme.</span></span></span></p></li><li dir=\"ltr\" style=\"list-style-type: disc; font-size: 9pt; font-family: Poppins, sans-serif; color: rgb(0, 0, 0); background-color: transparent; font-variant-numeric: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; font-variant-alternates: normal; font-variant-position: normal; font-variant-emoji: normal; vertical-align: baseline; white-space: pre; margin-left: 18pt; padding-left: 41.35pt;\" aria-level=\"1\"><p dir=\"ltr\" style=\"line-height:1.2;margin-top:5pt;margin-bottom:5pt;\" role=\"presentation\"><span style=\"font-size: 11pt; background-color: transparent; font-variant-numeric: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; font-variant-alternates: normal; font-variant-position: normal; font-variant-emoji: normal; vertical-align: baseline; text-wrap-mode: wrap;\"><span style=\"font-size: 18px;\"><span style=\"font-family: var(--font-inter), Inter, sans-serif;\">Virtual collectible figures called CryptoPunks.</span></span></span></p></li><li dir=\"ltr\" style=\"list-style-type: disc; font-size: 9pt; font-family: Poppins, sans-serif; color: rgb(0, 0, 0); background-color: transparent; font-variant-numeric: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; font-variant-alternates: normal; font-variant-position: normal; font-variant-emoji: normal; vertical-align: baseline; white-space: pre; margin-left: 18pt; padding-left: 41.35pt;\" aria-level=\"1\"><p dir=\"ltr\" style=\"line-height:1.2;margin-top:5pt;margin-bottom:5pt;\" role=\"presentation\"><span style=\"font-size: 11pt; background-color: transparent; font-variant-numeric: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; font-variant-alternates: normal; font-variant-position: normal; font-variant-emoji: normal; vertical-align: baseline; text-wrap-mode: wrap;\"><span style=\"font-size: 18px;\"><span style=\"font-family: var(--font-inter), Inter, sans-serif;\">A series of GIFs and images commissioned by Taco Bell, with proceeds going to the restaurant chain\'s charity.</span></span></span></p></li><li dir=\"ltr\" style=\"list-style-type: disc; font-size: 9pt; font-family: Poppins, sans-serif; color: rgb(0, 0, 0); background-color: transparent; font-variant-numeric: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; font-variant-alternates: normal; font-variant-position: normal; font-variant-emoji: normal; vertical-align: baseline; white-space: pre; margin-left: 18pt; padding-left: 41.35pt;\" aria-level=\"1\"><p dir=\"ltr\" style=\"line-height:1.2;margin-top:5pt;margin-bottom:5pt;\" role=\"presentation\"><span style=\"font-size: 11pt; background-color: transparent; font-variant-numeric: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; font-variant-alternates: normal; font-variant-position: normal; font-variant-emoji: normal; vertical-align: baseline; text-wrap-mode: wrap;\"><span style=\"font-size: 18px;\"><span style=\"font-family: var(--font-inter), Inter, sans-serif;\">Virtual real estate in Decentraland, a 3D virtual reality (VR) platform.</span></span></span></p></li><li dir=\"ltr\" style=\"list-style-type: disc; font-size: 9pt; font-family: Poppins, sans-serif; color: rgb(0, 0, 0); background-color: transparent; font-variant-numeric: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; font-variant-alternates: normal; font-variant-position: normal; font-variant-emoji: normal; vertical-align: baseline; white-space: pre; margin-left: 18pt; padding-left: 41.35pt;\" aria-level=\"1\"><p dir=\"ltr\" style=\"line-height:1.2;margin-top:5pt;margin-bottom:5pt;\" role=\"presentation\"><span style=\"font-size: 11pt; background-color: transparent; font-variant-numeric: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; font-variant-alternates: normal; font-variant-position: normal; font-variant-emoji: normal; vertical-align: baseline; text-wrap-mode: wrap;\"><span style=\"font-size: 18px;\"><span style=\"font-family: var(--font-inter), Inter, sans-serif;\">Tokenized real assets, such as real estate.</span></span></span></p></li></ul><p dir=\"ltr\" style=\"line-height:1.2;margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;\"><span style=\"font-size: 11pt; font-family: Poppins, sans-serif; color: rgb(0, 0, 0); background-color: transparent; font-variant-numeric: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; font-variant-alternates: normal; font-variant-position: normal; font-variant-emoji: normal; vertical-align: baseline; white-space-collapse: preserve;\"><span style=\"font-size: 18px;\"><span style=\"font-family: var(--font-inter), Inter, sans-serif;\">Today, the primary owners and collectors of NFTs are enthusiasts with a strong interest in a domain or project. However, NFTs are expected to become mainstream as products and technology improve, attracting retail investors as well.</span></span></span></p><div><span style=\"font-size: 11pt; font-family: Poppins, sans-serif; color: rgb(0, 0, 0); background-color: transparent; font-variant-numeric: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; font-variant-alternates: normal; font-variant-position: normal; font-variant-emoji: normal; vertical-align: baseline; white-space-collapse: preserve;\"><br></span>\n</div></span>\n</div>',1,0,70,'2025-09-12 07:40:33','2025-10-08 11:38:22'),(236,37,'How are NFTs created?','<div class=\"prose prose-lg max-w-none space-y-4\">\n\n<span id=\"docs-internal-guid-51874e37-7fff-d721-f9fd-c8cb757403d5\"><p dir=\"ltr\" style=\"line-height:1.2;margin-top:5pt;margin-bottom:5pt;\"><span style=\"font-size: 11pt; font-family: Poppins, sans-serif; color: rgb(0, 0, 0); background-color: transparent; font-variant-numeric: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; font-variant-alternates: normal; font-variant-position: normal; font-variant-emoji: normal; vertical-align: baseline; white-space-collapse: preserve;\"><span style=\"font-size: 18px;\"><span style=\"font-family: var(--font-inter), Inter, sans-serif;\">NFTs are created using smart contracts. The smart contract code is integrated into the token when it is created or minted. The smart contract stored on the blockchain determines the properties of the NFT, such as ownership and transferability. The smart contract is autonomous and contains the terms and conditions of an agreement directly in the lines of code. Each NFT is linked to a single token stored in a smart contract that runs on the distributed ledger to ensure proof of ownership and verifiable originality. Even if there are other copies of the same content, only one person can be in possession of the special token that confirms the ownership of the NFT.</span></span></span></p><p dir=\"ltr\" style=\"line-height:1.2;margin-top:5pt;margin-bottom:5pt;\"><span style=\"font-size: 11pt; font-family: Poppins, sans-serif; color: rgb(0, 0, 0); background-color: transparent; font-variant-numeric: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; font-variant-alternates: normal; font-variant-position: normal; font-variant-emoji: normal; vertical-align: baseline; white-space-collapse: preserve;\"><span style=\"font-size: 18px;\"><span style=\"font-family: var(--font-inter), Inter, sans-serif;\">Smart contracts are a crucial feature of blockchain technology. While many NFTs are based on the Ethereum blockchain, there are also some that are based on other blockchain technologies such as Tron and Neo. Blockchain also helps keep NFTs secure. The use of blockchain generates greenhouse gases that have a significant impact on the global carbon footprint.</span></span></span></p><div><span style=\"font-size: 11pt; font-family: Poppins, sans-serif; color: rgb(0, 0, 0); background-color: transparent; font-variant-numeric: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; font-variant-alternates: normal; font-variant-position: normal; font-variant-emoji: normal; vertical-align: baseline; white-space-collapse: preserve;\"><br></span>\n</div></span>\n</div>',1,0,70,'2025-09-12 07:41:25','2025-10-08 11:38:44'),(237,37,'How are NFTs bought and sold?','<div class=\"prose prose-lg max-w-none space-y-4\">\n\n<span id=\"docs-internal-guid-9a213f4c-7fff-2a32-d1d3-da61fd3381e0\"><p dir=\"ltr\" style=\"line-height:1.2;margin-top:5pt;margin-bottom:5pt;\"><span style=\"font-size: 11pt; font-family: Poppins, sans-serif; color: rgb(0, 0, 0); background-color: transparent; font-variant-numeric: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; font-variant-alternates: normal; font-variant-position: normal; font-variant-emoji: normal; vertical-align: baseline; white-space-collapse: preserve;\"><span style=\"font-family: var(--font-inter), Inter, sans-serif;\"><span style=\"font-size: 18px;\">s the demand for NFTs increases, new marketplaces are constantly emerging. Popular marketplaces for selling NFTs include the following:</span></span></span></p><ul style=\"padding-inline-start: 48px;\"><li dir=\"ltr\" style=\"list-style-type: disc; font-size: 9pt; font-family: Poppins, sans-serif; color: rgb(0, 0, 0); background-color: transparent; font-variant-numeric: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; font-variant-alternates: normal; font-variant-position: normal; font-variant-emoji: normal; vertical-align: baseline; white-space: pre; margin-left: 77.35pt;\" aria-level=\"1\"><p dir=\"ltr\" style=\"line-height:1.2;margin-top:5pt;margin-bottom:5pt;\" role=\"presentation\"><span style=\"font-size: 11pt; background-color: transparent; font-variant-numeric: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; font-variant-alternates: normal; font-variant-position: normal; font-variant-emoji: normal; vertical-align: baseline; text-wrap-mode: wrap;\"><span style=\"font-family: var(--font-inter), Inter, sans-serif;\"><span style=\"font-size: 18px;\">AtomicMarket.</span></span></span></p></li><li dir=\"ltr\" style=\"list-style-type: disc; font-size: 9pt; font-family: Poppins, sans-serif; color: rgb(0, 0, 0); background-color: transparent; font-variant-numeric: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; font-variant-alternates: normal; font-variant-position: normal; font-variant-emoji: normal; vertical-align: baseline; white-space: pre; margin-left: 77.35pt;\" aria-level=\"1\"><p dir=\"ltr\" style=\"line-height:1.2;margin-top:5pt;margin-bottom:5pt;\" role=\"presentation\"><span style=\"font-size: 11pt; background-color: transparent; font-variant-numeric: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; font-variant-alternates: normal; font-variant-position: normal; font-variant-emoji: normal; vertical-align: baseline; text-wrap-mode: wrap;\"><span style=\"font-family: var(--font-inter), Inter, sans-serif;\"><span style=\"font-size: 18px;\">BakerySwap.</span></span></span></p></li><li dir=\"ltr\" style=\"list-style-type: disc; font-size: 9pt; font-family: Poppins, sans-serif; color: rgb(0, 0, 0); background-color: transparent; font-variant-numeric: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; font-variant-alternates: normal; font-variant-position: normal; font-variant-emoji: normal; vertical-align: baseline; white-space: pre; margin-left: 77.35pt;\" aria-level=\"1\"><p dir=\"ltr\" style=\"line-height:1.2;margin-top:5pt;margin-bottom:5pt;\" role=\"presentation\"><span style=\"font-size: 11pt; background-color: transparent; font-variant-numeric: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; font-variant-alternates: normal; font-variant-position: normal; font-variant-emoji: normal; vertical-align: baseline; text-wrap-mode: wrap;\"><span style=\"font-family: var(--font-inter), Inter, sans-serif;\"><span style=\"font-size: 18px;\">Enjin.</span></span></span></p></li><li dir=\"ltr\" style=\"list-style-type: disc; font-size: 9pt; font-family: Poppins, sans-serif; color: rgb(0, 0, 0); background-color: transparent; font-variant-numeric: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; font-variant-alternates: normal; font-variant-position: normal; font-variant-emoji: normal; vertical-align: baseline; white-space: pre; margin-left: 77.35pt;\" aria-level=\"1\"><p dir=\"ltr\" style=\"line-height:1.2;margin-top:5pt;margin-bottom:5pt;\" role=\"presentation\"><span style=\"font-size: 11pt; background-color: transparent; font-variant-numeric: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; font-variant-alternates: normal; font-variant-position: normal; font-variant-emoji: normal; vertical-align: baseline; text-wrap-mode: wrap;\"><span style=\"font-family: var(--font-inter), Inter, sans-serif;\"><span style=\"font-size: 18px;\">Foundation.</span></span></span></p></li><li dir=\"ltr\" style=\"list-style-type: disc; font-size: 9pt; font-family: Poppins, sans-serif; color: rgb(0, 0, 0); background-color: transparent; font-variant-numeric: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; font-variant-alternates: normal; font-variant-position: normal; font-variant-emoji: normal; vertical-align: baseline; white-space: pre; margin-left: 77.35pt;\" aria-level=\"1\"><p dir=\"ltr\" style=\"line-height:1.2;margin-top:5pt;margin-bottom:5pt;\" role=\"presentation\"><span style=\"font-size: 11pt; background-color: transparent; font-variant-numeric: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; font-variant-alternates: normal; font-variant-position: normal; font-variant-emoji: normal; vertical-align: baseline; text-wrap-mode: wrap;\"><span style=\"font-family: var(--font-inter), Inter, sans-serif;\"><span style=\"font-size: 18px;\">KnownOrigin.</span></span></span></p></li><li dir=\"ltr\" style=\"list-style-type: disc; font-size: 9pt; font-family: Poppins, sans-serif; color: rgb(0, 0, 0); background-color: transparent; font-variant-numeric: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; font-variant-alternates: normal; font-variant-position: normal; font-variant-emoji: normal; vertical-align: baseline; white-space: pre; margin-left: 77.35pt;\" aria-level=\"1\"><p dir=\"ltr\" style=\"line-height:1.2;margin-top:5pt;margin-bottom:5pt;\" role=\"presentation\"><span style=\"font-size: 11pt; background-color: transparent; font-variant-numeric: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; font-variant-alternates: normal; font-variant-position: normal; font-variant-emoji: normal; vertical-align: baseline; text-wrap-mode: wrap;\"><span style=\"font-family: var(--font-inter), Inter, sans-serif;\"><span style=\"font-size: 18px;\">Myth Market.</span></span></span></p></li><li dir=\"ltr\" style=\"list-style-type: disc; font-size: 9pt; font-family: Poppins, sans-serif; color: rgb(0, 0, 0); background-color: transparent; font-variant-numeric: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; font-variant-alternates: normal; font-variant-position: normal; font-variant-emoji: normal; vertical-align: baseline; white-space: pre; margin-left: 77.35pt;\" aria-level=\"1\"><p dir=\"ltr\" style=\"line-height:1.2;margin-top:5pt;margin-bottom:5pt;\" role=\"presentation\"><span style=\"font-size: 11pt; background-color: transparent; font-variant-numeric: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; font-variant-alternates: normal; font-variant-position: normal; font-variant-emoji: normal; vertical-align: baseline; text-wrap-mode: wrap;\"><span style=\"font-family: var(--font-inter), Inter, sans-serif;\"><span style=\"font-size: 18px;\">OpenSea.</span></span></span></p></li><li dir=\"ltr\" style=\"list-style-type: disc; font-size: 9pt; font-family: Poppins, sans-serif; color: rgb(0, 0, 0); background-color: transparent; font-variant-numeric: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; font-variant-alternates: normal; font-variant-position: normal; font-variant-emoji: normal; vertical-align: baseline; white-space: pre; margin-left: 77.35pt;\" aria-level=\"1\"><p dir=\"ltr\" style=\"line-height:1.2;margin-top:5pt;margin-bottom:5pt;\" role=\"presentation\"><span style=\"font-size: 11pt; background-color: transparent; font-variant-numeric: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; font-variant-alternates: normal; font-variant-position: normal; font-variant-emoji: normal; vertical-align: baseline; text-wrap-mode: wrap;\"><span style=\"font-family: var(--font-inter), Inter, sans-serif;\"><span style=\"font-size: 18px;\">Rarible.</span></span></span></p></li><li dir=\"ltr\" style=\"list-style-type: disc; font-size: 9pt; font-family: Poppins, sans-serif; color: rgb(0, 0, 0); background-color: transparent; font-variant-numeric: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; font-variant-alternates: normal; font-variant-position: normal; font-variant-emoji: normal; vertical-align: baseline; white-space: pre; margin-left: 77.35pt;\" aria-level=\"1\"><p dir=\"ltr\" style=\"line-height:1.2;margin-top:5pt;margin-bottom:5pt;\" role=\"presentation\"><span style=\"font-size: 11pt; background-color: transparent; font-variant-numeric: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; font-variant-alternates: normal; font-variant-position: normal; font-variant-emoji: normal; vertical-align: baseline; text-wrap-mode: wrap;\"><span style=\"font-family: var(--font-inter), Inter, sans-serif;\"><span style=\"font-size: 18px;\">SuperRare.</span></span></span></p></li></ul><p dir=\"ltr\" style=\"line-height:1.2;margin-top:5pt;margin-bottom:5pt;\"><span style=\"font-size: 11pt; font-family: Poppins, sans-serif; color: rgb(0, 0, 0); background-color: transparent; font-variant-numeric: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; font-variant-alternates: normal; font-variant-position: normal; font-variant-emoji: normal; vertical-align: baseline; white-space-collapse: preserve;\"><span style=\"font-family: var(--font-inter), Inter, sans-serif;\"><span style=\"font-size: 18px;\">The following are the steps for buying and selling NFTs:</span></span></span></p><ol style=\"padding-inline-start: 48px;\"><li dir=\"ltr\" style=\"list-style-type: decimal; font-size: 11pt; font-family: Poppins, sans-serif; color: rgb(0, 0, 0); background-color: transparent; font-variant-numeric: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; font-variant-alternates: normal; font-variant-position: normal; font-variant-emoji: normal; vertical-align: baseline; white-space: pre; margin-left: 77.35pt;\" aria-level=\"1\"><p dir=\"ltr\" style=\"line-height:1.2;margin-top:5pt;margin-bottom:5pt;\" role=\"presentation\"><span style=\"font-size: 11pt; background-color: transparent; font-variant-numeric: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; font-variant-alternates: normal; font-variant-position: normal; font-variant-emoji: normal; vertical-align: baseline; text-wrap-mode: wrap;\"><span style=\"font-family: var(--font-inter), Inter, sans-serif;\"><span style=\"font-size: 18px;\">Set up a digital wallet and buy cryptocurrencies like Ether with an app like Coinbase or MetaMask.</span></span></span></p></li><li dir=\"ltr\" style=\"list-style-type: decimal; font-size: 11pt; font-family: Poppins, sans-serif; color: rgb(0, 0, 0); background-color: transparent; font-variant-numeric: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; font-variant-alternates: normal; font-variant-position: normal; font-variant-emoji: normal; vertical-align: baseline; white-space: pre; margin-left: 77.35pt;\" aria-level=\"1\"><p dir=\"ltr\" style=\"line-height:1.2;margin-top:5pt;margin-bottom:5pt;\" role=\"presentation\"><span style=\"font-size: 11pt; background-color: transparent; font-variant-numeric: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; font-variant-alternates: normal; font-variant-position: normal; font-variant-emoji: normal; vertical-align: baseline; text-wrap-mode: wrap;\"><span style=\"font-family: var(--font-inter), Inter, sans-serif;\"><span style=\"font-size: 18px;\">Connect the digital wallet to an NFT marketplace.</span></span></span></p></li><li dir=\"ltr\" style=\"list-style-type: decimal; font-size: 11pt; font-family: Poppins, sans-serif; color: rgb(0, 0, 0); background-color: transparent; font-variant-numeric: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; font-variant-alternates: normal; font-variant-position: normal; font-variant-emoji: normal; vertical-align: baseline; white-space: pre; margin-left: 77.35pt;\" aria-level=\"1\"><p dir=\"ltr\" style=\"line-height:1.2;margin-top:5pt;margin-bottom:5pt;\" role=\"presentation\"><span style=\"font-size: 11pt; background-color: transparent; font-variant-numeric: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; font-variant-alternates: normal; font-variant-position: normal; font-variant-emoji: normal; vertical-align: baseline; text-wrap-mode: wrap;\"><span style=\"font-family: var(--font-inter), Inter, sans-serif;\"><span style=\"font-size: 18px;\">Release NFT for sale or bid on or buy content. Depending on the seller and marketplace, users can place bids or buy directly.</span></span></span></p></li></ol><br><p dir=\"ltr\" style=\"line-height:1.2;margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;\"><span style=\"font-size: 11pt; font-family: Poppins, sans-serif; color: rgb(0, 0, 0); background-color: transparent; font-weight: 700; font-variant-numeric: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; font-variant-alternates: normal; font-variant-position: normal; font-variant-emoji: normal; vertical-align: baseline; white-space-collapse: preserve;\"><span style=\"font-family: var(--font-inter), Inter, sans-serif;\"><span style=\"font-size: 18px;\">Challenges and risks:</span></span></span></p><p dir=\"ltr\" style=\"line-height:1.2;margin-top:5pt;margin-bottom:5pt;\"><span style=\"font-size: 11pt; font-family: Poppins, sans-serif; color: rgb(0, 0, 0); background-color: transparent; font-variant-numeric: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; font-variant-alternates: normal; font-variant-position: normal; font-variant-emoji: normal; vertical-align: baseline; white-space-collapse: preserve;\"><span style=\"font-family: var(--font-inter), Inter, sans-serif;\"><span style=\"font-size: 18px;\">In the NFT space, there are several types of scams to watch out for, including the following:</span></span></span></p><ul style=\"padding-inline-start: 48px;\"><li dir=\"ltr\" style=\"list-style-type: disc; font-size: 9pt; font-family: Poppins, sans-serif; color: rgb(0, 0, 0); background-color: transparent; font-variant-numeric: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; font-variant-alternates: normal; font-variant-position: normal; font-variant-emoji: normal; vertical-align: baseline; white-space: pre; margin-left: 77.35pt;\" aria-level=\"1\"><p dir=\"ltr\" style=\"line-height:1.2;margin-top:5pt;margin-bottom:5pt;\" role=\"presentation\"><span style=\"font-size: 11pt; background-color: transparent; font-variant-numeric: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; font-variant-alternates: normal; font-variant-position: normal; font-variant-emoji: normal; vertical-align: baseline; text-wrap-mode: wrap;\"><span style=\"font-family: var(--font-inter), Inter, sans-serif;\"><span style=\"font-size: 18px;\">Phishing scams. Phishing scams are fraudulent links or pop-ups that trick users into revealing sensitive information or transferring money to fraudulent accounts. NFT phishers create fake marketplaces or social media accounts and trick users into giving them their private keys under the guise of making payments for nonexistent NFTs. To avoid falling for phishing scams, it is important to verify the authenticity of websites and check URLs before entering personal information or making transactions. Key secrecy is an important measure to avoid NFT fraud.</span></span></span></p></li><li dir=\"ltr\" style=\"list-style-type: disc; font-size: 9pt; font-family: Poppins, sans-serif; color: rgb(0, 0, 0); background-color: transparent; font-variant-numeric: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; font-variant-alternates: normal; font-variant-position: normal; font-variant-emoji: normal; vertical-align: baseline; white-space: pre; margin-left: 77.35pt;\" aria-level=\"1\"><p dir=\"ltr\" style=\"line-height:1.2;margin-top:5pt;margin-bottom:5pt;\" role=\"presentation\"><span style=\"font-size: 11pt; background-color: transparent; font-variant-numeric: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; font-variant-alternates: normal; font-variant-position: normal; font-variant-emoji: normal; vertical-align: baseline; text-wrap-mode: wrap;\"><span style=\"font-family: var(--font-inter), Inter, sans-serif;\"><span style=\"font-size: 18px;\">Fake NFTs. Fake NFTs are scammers who sell the work of others as their own original works. Fake NFTs appear identical to real digital collectibles or artwork, making it difficult for collectors to distinguish between real and fake tokens. To reduce the risk of buying fake NFTs, users should do their research, verify the artist\'s reputation and authenticity, and buy from reputable marketplaces and verified sources.</span></span></span></p></li><li dir=\"ltr\" style=\"list-style-type: disc; font-size: 9pt; font-family: Poppins, sans-serif; color: rgb(0, 0, 0); background-color: transparent; font-variant-numeric: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; font-variant-alternates: normal; font-variant-position: normal; font-variant-emoji: normal; vertical-align: baseline; white-space: pre; margin-left: 77.35pt;\" aria-level=\"1\"><p dir=\"ltr\" style=\"line-height:1.2;margin-top:5pt;margin-bottom:5pt;\" role=\"presentation\"><span style=\"font-size: 11pt; background-color: transparent; font-variant-numeric: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; font-variant-alternates: normal; font-variant-position: normal; font-variant-emoji: normal; vertical-align: baseline; text-wrap-mode: wrap;\"><span style=\"font-family: var(--font-inter), Inter, sans-serif;\"><span style=\"font-size: 18px;\">Pump-and-dump practices. These are fraudulent schemes in which the price of an NFT is artificially inflated through coordinated marketing efforts, often emanating from influential individuals or groups. Pump-and-dump providers drive the price of an NFT to a peak and then liquidate their holdings, causing the value to plummet and other investors to suffer significant losses. Users should conduct thorough, independent research and assess the long-term value of an NFT and not make impulsive investments based on hype.</span></span></span></p></li><li dir=\"ltr\" style=\"list-style-type: disc; font-size: 9pt; font-family: Poppins, sans-serif; color: rgb(0, 0, 0); background-color: transparent; font-variant-numeric: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; font-variant-alternates: normal; font-variant-position: normal; font-variant-emoji: normal; vertical-align: baseline; white-space: pre; margin-left: 77.35pt;\" aria-level=\"1\"><p dir=\"ltr\" style=\"line-height:1.2;margin-top:5pt;margin-bottom:5pt;\" role=\"presentation\"><span style=\"font-size: 11pt; background-color: transparent; font-variant-numeric: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; font-variant-alternates: normal; font-variant-position: normal; font-variant-emoji: normal; vertical-align: baseline; text-wrap-mode: wrap;\"><span style=\"font-family: var(--font-inter), Inter, sans-serif;\"><span style=\"font-size: 18px;\">Scam with free mints. In free mint scams, scammers lure users into participating in fraudulent mints and promise exclusive NFTs or rewards. However, instead of receiving the promised NFTs, victims inadvertently relinquish control of their wallets or grant access to their private keys, resulting in unauthorized access to their funds or assets. To protect yourself from free coin scams, it is important to be careful when participating in NFT coin processes and to verify the legitimacy and security of the platforms or projects involved.</span></span></span></p></li></ul><p dir=\"ltr\" style=\"line-height:1.2;margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;\"><span style=\"font-size: 11pt; font-family: Poppins, sans-serif; color: rgb(0, 0, 0); background-color: transparent; font-weight: 700; font-variant-numeric: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; font-variant-alternates: normal; font-variant-position: normal; font-variant-emoji: normal; vertical-align: baseline; white-space-collapse: preserve;\"><span style=\"font-family: var(--font-inter), Inter, sans-serif;\"><span style=\"font-size: 18px;\">Future prospects and trends</span></span></span></p><p dir=\"ltr\" style=\"line-height:1.2;margin-top:5pt;margin-bottom:5pt;\"><span style=\"font-size: 11pt; font-family: Poppins, sans-serif; color: rgb(0, 0, 0); background-color: transparent; font-variant-numeric: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; font-variant-alternates: normal; font-variant-position: normal; font-variant-emoji: normal; vertical-align: baseline; white-space-collapse: preserve;\"><span style=\"font-family: var(--font-inter), Inter, sans-serif;\"><span style=\"font-size: 18px;\">The principles of supply and demand also apply to the NFT market. As with any investment, buyers should be cautious and keep a close eye on the market\'s development. \"An NFT is only worth as much as others are willing to pay for it,\" Herzig said. \"NFTs that can form a deep connection with collectors and investors are more likely to last for the long term.\" Collectors and investors should look at past and similar sales on established marketplaces to understand the value of NFTs. The long-term viability of NFTs will depend on how their utility value is perceived. As with other collectibles, this will be the case if owners view NFTs as uniquely valuable experiences or features. NFT communities will evolve and grow and help maintain prices and markets; this will increase confidence in their long-term survival. NFTs are also associated with future applications in the metaverse, the VR world, and healthcare. Because NFTs can prove immutable ownership of an asset, they could be used to protect patient data in healthcare. Other potential applications include proof of digital ownership rights in the metaverse and other VR worlds. Retailers have started using NFTs to sell digital products in the metaverse and prove ownership of digital deeds. NFTs are one of the new applications of blockchain technology. Learn the difference between NFTs and cryptocurrencies.</span></span></span></p><p dir=\"ltr\" style=\"line-height:1.2;margin-top:5pt;margin-bottom:5pt;\"><span style=\"font-size: 11pt; font-family: Poppins, sans-serif; color: rgb(0, 0, 0); background-color: transparent; font-variant-numeric: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; font-variant-alternates: normal; font-variant-position: normal; font-variant-emoji: normal; vertical-align: baseline; white-space-collapse: preserve;\"><span style=\"font-family: var(--font-inter), Inter, sans-serif;\"><span style=\"font-size: 18px;\">Top projects in NFTs:</span></span></span></p><p dir=\"ltr\" style=\"line-height:1.2;margin-top:5pt;margin-bottom:5pt;\"><span style=\"font-size: 11pt; font-family: Poppins, sans-serif; color: rgb(0, 0, 0); background-color: transparent; font-variant-numeric: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; font-variant-alternates: normal; font-variant-position: normal; font-variant-emoji: normal; vertical-align: baseline; white-space-collapse: preserve;\"><span style=\"font-family: var(--font-inter), Inter, sans-serif;\"><span style=\"font-size: 18px;\">Since 2017, many projects have been created as NFTs. According to The Block Research, there are at least 73 NFT platforms today—we list some of the most prominent below:</span></span></span></p><ul style=\"padding-inline-start: 48px;\"><li dir=\"ltr\" style=\"list-style-type: disc; font-size: 9pt; font-family: Poppins, sans-serif; color: rgb(0, 0, 0); background-color: transparent; font-variant-numeric: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; font-variant-alternates: normal; font-variant-position: normal; font-variant-emoji: normal; vertical-align: baseline; white-space: pre; margin-left: 77.35pt;\" aria-level=\"1\"><p dir=\"ltr\" style=\"line-height:1.2;margin-top:5pt;margin-bottom:5pt;\" role=\"presentation\"><span style=\"font-size: 11pt; background-color: transparent; font-variant-numeric: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; font-variant-alternates: normal; font-variant-position: normal; font-variant-emoji: normal; vertical-align: baseline; text-wrap-mode: wrap;\"><span style=\"font-family: var(--font-inter), Inter, sans-serif;\"><span style=\"font-size: 18px;\">Collectibles—CryptoPunks: Algorithmically generated collectible characters developed by Larva Labs</span></span></span></p></li><li dir=\"ltr\" style=\"list-style-type: disc; font-size: 9pt; font-family: Poppins, sans-serif; color: rgb(0, 0, 0); background-color: transparent; font-variant-numeric: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; font-variant-alternates: normal; font-variant-position: normal; font-variant-emoji: normal; vertical-align: baseline; white-space: pre; margin-left: 77.35pt;\" aria-level=\"1\"><p dir=\"ltr\" style=\"line-height:1.2;margin-top:5pt;margin-bottom:5pt;\" role=\"presentation\"><span style=\"font-size: 11pt; background-color: transparent; font-variant-numeric: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; font-va