", \"SEO specialist\"]','[\"English\", \"Amharic\"]','Full Time','Yes, I\'m available now','Other: Telegram',NULL,'I am a full-stack web developer specializing in building fast, scalable, and visually appealing web applications. My core strength lies in the modern React/Next.js ecosystem, paired with a powerful Node.js backend.\r\n\r\nMy key technical skills include:\r\nFrontend Development: Building responsive and dynamic user interfaces with React.js and Next.js, styled with Tailwind CSS and ShadCN/ui, and brought to life with Framer Motion animations.\r\nBackend Development: Creating robust RESTful APIs and server-side logic using Node.js and Express.js.\r\nDatabase & ORM: Designing and managing databases with MongoDB and PostgreSQL, using Prisma and Mongoose for efficient data handling.\r\nEnd-to-End Solutions: I deliver complete projects, from SaaS platforms and E-commerce sites to admin dashboards and portfolios, ensuring clean, maintainable, and client-focused code.\r\n\r\nMy primary toolkit consists of:\r\nLanguages: JavaScript (ES6+), HTML, CSS\r\nFrameworks: React.js, Next.js, Node.js, Express.js\r\nStyling & UI: Tailwind CSS, ShadCN/ui, Framer Motion\r\nDatabases & ORMs: MongoDB, PostgreSQL, Prisma, Mongoose\r\nTools & Platforms: Git, GitHub, Vercel, Cloudinary, Postman\r\n\r\nI focus on writing clean, scalable code and maintaining reliable communication to turn your ideas into high-performance digital products.','https://backendapi.ptgr.org/api/uploads/cv/cv-1760152296789-507509485.pdf','2026-02-18 07:36:34'),(16,0,'Natnael Derseh','natnaeldersehbekele@gmail.com','Ethiopia','Addis Abeba','+251987446949','18–24','Male','Diploma/Certificate','2–3 years','[\"Graphic designer\"]','[\"English\", \"Amharic\"]','Remote','Yes, I\'m available now','LinkedIn',NULL,'I work with adobe photoshop and adobe illustration','https://backendapi.ptgr.org/api/uploads/cv/cv-1760042264058-295358672.pdf','2026-02-18 07:36:35'),(17,0,'Betelhem Kirub','betelhemkirub@gmail.com','E