erience in building scalable web applications and user-centric platforms. I specialize in React.js, Next.js, Tailwind CSS, Node.js, and Express.js, and I design intuitive user interfaces with Figma. I have led teams, mentored junior developers, and built platforms such as Akil (A2SV), YubaNow(LLM-powered research digitization platform), and Eskalate (offshore talent connection platform). My portfolio includes responsive UI/UX design, secure authentication systems, AI-powered features, and performance optimization.','https://backendapi.ptgr.org/api/uploads/cv/cv-1759154304781-812389851.pdf','2026-02-18 07:36:35'),(20,0,'Kirubel Kassahun','kirubelkassahun9@gmail.com','Ethiopia','Addis Ababa','+251927192054','25–34','Male','Bachelor\'s degree','2–3 years','[\"Full-stack Developer\"]','[\"English\"]','Full Time','Yes, I\'m available now','LinkedIn',NULL,'I am writing to express my interest in the Full stack developer position . With three years of hands-on experience as a web and software developer, I have developed a strong skill set in building modern, scalable, and user-friendly applications.\r\nMy journey in development has allowed me to work with a wide range of technologies. On the frontend, I specialize in React.js and Next.js, combining them with TailwindCSS and TypeScript to create clean, responsive, and maintainable user interfaces. On the backend, I have solid experience with Express.js, and I have worked extensively with relational databases such as MySQL and PostgreSQL, often leveraging Prisma ORM for efficient and type-safe database management.\r\nBeyond coding, I also value design. I regularly use Figma to design and prototype UI/UX experiences, ensuring that applications are not only functional but also intuitive and visually engaging. This combination of design thinking and technical execution allows me to deliver end-to-end solutions—from initial concept and wireframing to deployment and optimization.\r\nI am passionate about continuous learning and thrive in collaborative environments where I can contribute to solving real-world problems with technology. I believe my background aligns well with your team’s goals, and I am excited about the opportunity to bring my skills \r\nThank you for considering my application. I would be delighted to discuss how my experience can add value to your team.\r\nSincerely,\r\n\r\nKirubel Kassahun','https://backendapi.ptgr.org/api/uploads/cv/cv-1759147136369-87749605.pdf','2026-02-18 07:36:35'),(21,0,'Natnael Getachew','leantanget2@gmail.com','Ethiopia','Addis Ababa','+251904592988','25–34','Male','Bachelor\'s degree','2–3 years','[\"Frontend Developer\"]','[\"English\", \"Amharic\"]','Full Time','Yes, I\'m available now','Friend or referral',NULL,'I am a frontend developer having experience with react js and vue js and using tools like tailwind css, sass, Antdesign, react query and shadcn.','https://backendapi.ptgr.org/api/uploads/cv/cv-1759135634931-795294225.pdf','2026-02-18 07:36:35'),(22,0,'Yonas Halefom Messele','contact@yonashalefom.com','Ethiopia','Addis Ababa','+251923937882','25–34','Male','Bachelor\'s degree','4+','[\"Frontend Developer\", \"Full-stack Developer\", \"UI/UX Designer\", \"Backend Developer\", \"Mobile App Developer\", \"Graphic designer\", \"Content created\"]','[\"English\"]','Remote','Yes, I\'m available now','Other: Telegram',NULL,'Nest.js, Node.js, Next.js, React Router 7 (Framework), MongoDB, PostgreSQL, GraphQL','https://backendapi.ptgr.org/api/uploads/cv/cv-1759135032145-127636775.pdf','2026-02-18 07:36:35'),(23,0,'Yodahe Teshome','yodaheteshome1@gmail.com','Ethiopia','Addis Ababa','+251945048922','18–24','Male','Bachelor\'s degree','2–3 years','[\"Frontend Developer\", \"Full-stack Developer\", \"Backend Developer\", \"Data Analyst / Data Scientist\"]','[\"English\", \"Amharic\"]','Open to all','Yes, I\'m available now','Friend or referral',NULL,'I bring experience across data science and full-stack development. On the data side, I work with Pytho