repos\r\n* 4700+ contributions \r\n* 1400+ hours of coding recorded on wakatime in the last 6 months\r\n* worked on 2 real production projects','https://backendapi.ptgr.org/api/uploads/cv/cv-1757166389734-962960853.pdf','2026-02-18 07:36:36'),(201,0,'Hailegabriel Mekonen','haile.mak11@gmail.com','Ethiopia','addis ababa','+2510937930659','25–34','Male','Bachelor\'s degree','5+ years','[\"Full-stack Developer\", \"Backend Developer\", \"Frontend Developer\", \"Mobile App Developer\"]','[\"English\"]','Open to all','Yes, I\'m available now','LinkedIn',NULL,'Currently, I work as a Mobile Engineer at Whyzzer (Germany), where I’ve been building and maintaining cross-platform applications distributed through TestFlight and the App Store. I’ve recently worked on STEREOPARK, a music player app, where I implemented features like background audio playback, in-app purchases using RevenueCat, deep linking with Branch IO, and seamless CI/CD integration with CircleCI.\r\n\r\nBefore that, I worked at Safaricom Ethiopia  as a Full Stack Engineer, where I led Flutter development on several mini-apps within the company’s Super App. This role also involved integrating with Alipay’s SDK, managing releases with Kubernetes, and collaborating across multiple engineering teams.\r\n\r\nAcross all my roles — from 2F Capital to Aleph Technologies — I’ve consistently delivered high-performing Flutter apps with solid architecture, efficient state management (BLoC, Provider, Riverpod), CI/CD automation (Fastlane, GitLab, GitHub Actions), and test-driven development practices.\r\n\r\nSome of my Flutter mobile projects include:\r\n\r\n- 🎵 STEREOPARK: Music player app with background play and in-app purchases\r\n- 🛍️ Wuqiyanosture: E-commerce mobile and web platform\r\n- 🧾 Delivery Management App: Real-time logistics tracking using Socket.IO (2F Capital)\r\n- 📚 Tutoring App: Scheduling and communication platform for learners (Aleph Technologies)\r\nYou can view some of my work on GitHub, The rest are not currently on stores. But the here is the GitHub link for Delivery Management app, https://github.com/Haileman11/lastmile_delivery  . Here is the link for stereo park, https://apps.apple.com/us/app/stereopark/id6677052268. I am also working on Creator Community Management app Koalo, https://apps.apple.com/us/app/koalo/id6636496502.','https://backendapi.ptgr.org/api/uploads/cv/cv-1757144550390-421810146.pdf','2026-02-18 07:36:36'),(202,0,'Eyosiyas','tdjosy@gmail.com','Ethiopia','Addis Ababa','+251923522253','25–34','Male','Bachelor\'s degree','5+ years','[\"Frontend Developer\", \"Backend Developer\", \"Full-stack Developer\", \"Mobile App Developer\", \"Quality Assurance\"]','[\"English\", \"Amharic\"]','Remote','Yes, I\'m available now','LinkedIn',NULL,'I’m a full-stack engineer with strong expertise in Node.js, NestJS, and React/Next.js, building scalable backend systems and intuitive frontends. I work with PostgreSQL, MongoDB, and Redis for data solutions, and deploy using AWS, Docker, and Kubernetes for reliability and scale. I also integrate AI tools like OpenAI and LangChain to enhance applications with intelligent features. My focus is always on writing clean, maintainable code, optimizing performance, and delivering real value to users.','https://backendapi.ptgr.org/api/uploads/cv/cv-1757143108267-802181892.pdf','2026-02-18 07:36:36'),(203,0,'Jenish Dhameliya','jenishdhameliya2001@gmail.com','Other',NULL,'394101+918469513435','25–34','Male','Bachelor\'s degree','5+ years','[\"Full-stack Developer\", \"Frontend Developer\", \"Backend Developer\"]','[\"English\"]','Remote','Yes, I\'m available now','LinkedIn',NULL,'I’ve been working with the MERN stack for 5+ years, creating SaaS products, web apps, and automation tools that streamline workflows. My expertise includes React.js, Next.js, Node.js, MongoDB/Postgres, Tailwind, and AWS (EC2, Lambda, S3). I’ve also integrated APIs like Stripe, Twilio, and Zoom to build scalable, feature-rich solutions.','https://backendapi.ptgr.org/api/uploads/cv/cv-1757056729592-426506416.pdf','2026-02-18 07:36:36'),(204,0,'Hemanshu Tala','hemansutala@gmail.com','Other','Ahmedabad','+916351937876','18–24','Male','Still in university','0–1 year','[\"Frontend Developer\", \"Backend Developer\", \"Full-stack Developer\", \"Mobile App Developer\", \"UI/UX Designer\"]','[\"English\", \"Hindi\"]','Remote','Yes, I\'m available now','Website',NULL,'I have hands-on experience in full-stack development using HTML, CSS, JavaScript, React.js, Node.js, Express.js, MongoDB, Flutter, Python, and C++. I also work with FastAPI and Flask for machine learning model integration. My skills include REST APIs, database management, QR code integration, and dynamic UI/UX design. I use Figma for design and have experience building responsive web and mobile applications with real-time data features.','https://backendapi.ptgr.org/api/uploads/cv/cv-1757042554265-496155529.pdf','2026-02-18 07:36:36'),(205,0,'jemaneh','jemaneh.aklog@ptgr.org','Ethiopia','Zug','+251970474415','25–34','Prefer not to say','Still in university','0–1 year','[\"Accounting and Finance\", \"Frontend Developer\"]','[\"English\"]','Remote','Yes, I\'m available now','LinkedIn',NULL,'sfsdf','https://backendapi.ptgr.org/api/uploads/cv/cv-1757016454310-512598694.pdf','2026-02-18 07:36:36'),(206,0,'Jemaneh Mekbeb','jemaneh.2011@gmail.com','Ethiopia','Addis Ababa','+251911520105','18–24','Male','Still in university','0–1 year','[\"Accounting and Finance\", \"Frontend Developer\", \"Full-stack Developer\"]','[\"English\"]','Remote','Yes, I\'m available now','LinkedIn',NULL,'test','https://backendapi.ptgr.org/api/uploads/cv/cv-1757015908568-774492780.pdf','2026-02-18 07:36:36'),(207,0,'John Doe','john@example.com','USA','New York','+1234567890','25–34','Male','Bachelor\'s degree','3–5 years','[\"JavaScript\", \"React\", \"Node.js\"]','[\"English\", \"Spanish\"]','Remote','Yes, I\'m available now','LinkedIn',NULL,'Experienced full-stack developer...','https://backendapi.ptgr.org/api/uploads/cv/cv-1757015330719-152313849.pdf','2026-02-18 07:36:36'),(208,0,'Jemaneh Aklog','jemaneh.aklog@ptgr.com','Ethiopia','Zug','+251970474415','18-24','female','Diploma/Certificate','0-1','[\"Frontend Developer\"]','[\"English\"]','Onsite','Immediate','Website',NULL,'test','uploads/cv/cv-1772631266158-600160924.pdf','2026-03-04 13:34:26'),(209,0,'Yerosen Tamrat','yerosentamrat4545@gmail.com','Ethiopia ','Addis ababa','+251945235859','18-24','male','Bachelor\'s degree','1-3','[\"Frontend Developer\", \"Backend Developer\", \"Full-stack Developer\", \"Mobile App Developer\", \"UI/UX Designer\", \"DSA\"]','[\"English\", \"Amharic\"]','Remote','Immediate','Event',NULL,'Im a full stack developer,  mainly using these tech stacks - nextjs, react, supabase. Also a good problem solver, deep knowledge in data structures and Algorithms using python ','uploads/cv/cv-1773124791338-710141022.pdf','2026-03-10 06:39:51'),(210,0,'Surafel Abebe','surafelsurafel1616@gmail.com','Ethiopia','Addis Ababa','+251993503418','18-24','male','Bootcamp/Self-taught','0-1','[\"Full-stack Developer\", \"Mobile App Developer\", \"Sales / Business Development\", \"Frontend Developer\", \"Project Manager (IT)\", \"Digital Marketing\", \"SEO / Content Marketing\", \"Performance Marketing\", \"UI/UX Designer\"]','[\"English\", \"Amharic\", \"Arabic\"]','Remote','Immediate','Event',NULL,'I am a developer with a focus on local community projects and emerging tech.\r\n​Technical Skills & Tools\r\n​Web & Mobile Development Expert in React, Expo, and Supabase. I am also an enthusiast for Web3 and blockchain technologies.\r\n​i Identifies as a \"vibe coder\" and \"prompt engineer,\" leveraging AI to streamline development.\r\n​Active Project: Currently developing an Equb monitoring dashboard, a digital tool for traditional Ethiopian savings groups.\r\n​Creative & Community Projects\r\n​Content Creation: Manages an Ethiopian Orthodox YouTube channel, focusing on religious and community-oriented content.\r\n​Local Initiatives: Has been involved in proposals like \"Explore Oromia,\" showing a clear interest in regional development and tourism.','uploads/cv/cv-1773128306733-640354588.pdf','2026-03-10 07:38:26'),(211,0,'Naod Demise Asefa','naoddemiseasefa@gmail.com','Ethiopia','Addis Ababa','0919894881','18-24','male','Bachelor\'s degree','3-5','[\"Full-stack Developer\", \"Backend Developer\", \"Frontend Developer\", \"UI/UX Designer\"]','[\"English\", \"Amharic\"]','Remote','Immediate','Event',NULL,'Web 3 Developer / Blockchain Technology (Smart Contracts & Cryptocurrencies) / Basic Python, Java, Javascript,\r\nHTML, CSS, NodeJS','uploads/cv/cv-1773232646409-327227359.pdf','2026-03-11 12:37:26'),(212,0,'Samuel Birhanu','samuelbirhanu234@gmail.com','Ethiopia','Addis Ababa','094 360 3973','18-24','male','Bachelor\'s degree','0-1','[\"Frontend Developer\", \"Backend Developer\"]','[\"English\", \"Amharic\"]','Remote','Immediate','Website',NULL,'I have strong full-stack development skills with experience building scalable web applications from the backend to the user interface. My primary strength is backend engineering, where I design and develop RESTful APIs, authentication systems, and database architectures using technologies such as Node.js, TypeScript, and relational databases. On the frontend, I have experience using modern frameworks like React to build responsive and user-friendly interfaces.\r\n\r\nI focus on writing clean, maintainable code and building systems that are secure, efficient, and production-ready. I also enjoy integrating different technologies together, including payment systems, cloud services, and blockchain applications. My ability to work across the full stack allows me to understand how different parts of a system interact and helps me deliver complete, end-to-end solutions that create real value for users and businesses.\r\n','uploads/cv/cv-1773233415301-550558014.pdf','2026-03-11 12:50:15'),(213,0,'Abraham Shimels','shimelsabraham123@gmail.com','Ethiopia','addis ababa','+251941124713','18-24','male','Bachelor\'s degree','1-3','[\"Frontend Developer\", \"Full-stack Developer\", \"DevOps / Cloud Engineer\", \"Backend Developer\", \"Mobile App Developer\"]','[\"English\", \"Amharic\"]','Open','Immediate','Event',NULL,'Full-stack developer with experience building scalable web applications. Skilled in JavaScript, Node.js, Express.js, and REST APIs for backend development, and HTML, CSS, and modern frontend frameworks for responsive user interfaces. Experienced with Git/GitHub, Linux (Kubuntu), VPS deployment, and database design using MongoDB/MySQL. Also familiar with API integrations, system architecture, and building real-world projects such as management systems and web platforms.','uploads/cv/cv-1773250526223-897775081.pdf','2026-03-11 17:35:26'),(214,0,'Gelila Fassil','gelilafassil659@gmail.com','Ethiopia','addis ababa','+251962464070','18-24','female','Diploma/Certificate','1-3','[\"Frontend Developer\", \"Full-stack Developer\", \"Backend Developer\"]','[\"Amharic\", \"English\"]','Remote','Immediate','Event',NULL,'I am a Full-Stack Developer with 2 years of experience building websites and applications. I specialize in React and Next.js for the frontend, and Node.js for the backend.\r\nI also work with Strapi and Sanity to manage content easily, and I use Docker to ensure my projects run smoothly in any environment.  I am passionate about using technology to solve real-world problems and am always eager to grow my skills.','uploads/cv/cv-1773408045730-920236495.pdf','2026-03-13 13:20:45'),(215,0,'BIRHANU MENGIST BIRHANU','bmb71161@gmail.com','Ethiopia','Addis Ababa','+251912338576','31-40','Male','Bachelor\'s Degree','5-10','[\"Sales Manager\", \"Team Building, Communication, Problem Solving , end to end computerized skills software :Word,excel,PowerPoint Pdf and other system app ...like ERP,Email, Outlook,BamboHR\"]','[\"English,&Amharic\"]','Hybrid','2 weeks','LinkedIn',NULL,'Date: June 10, 2026\r\nTo: Hiring Manager\r\nPTGR Company\r\nAddis Ababa, Ethiopia\r\n\r\nSubject: Application for Marketing Manager Position\r\nDear Hiring Manager,\r\nI am writing to express my strong interest in the Marketing Manager position at PTGR Company in Addis Ababa. With my background in customer service, business operations, communication, and team coordination, I am confident in my ability to contribute effectively to your organization’s marketing and business growth objectives.\r\nI have developed strong skills in customer relationship management, sales support, market communication, and operational coordination through my professional experience. I am highly motivated, organized, and capable of working under pressure while maintaining excellent professional standards. I also possess strong interpersonal and leadership skills that help me build productive relationships with clients, colleagues, and business partners.\r\nI am particularly interested in joining PTGR Company because of its professional reputation and commitment to business excellence. I believe my dedication, problem-solving ability, and passion for marketing and customer engagement would make me a valuable addition to your team.\r\nIn addition, I am eager to learn new systems and contribute innovative ideas that can support brand awareness, customer satisfaction, and overall company performance. I am confident that my commitment to hard work and achieving results aligns with the goals of your organization.\r\nI would welcome the opportunity to discuss my qualifications further during an interview. Thank you for considering my application. I look forward to hearing from you.\r\n\r\nSincerely,\r\nBirhanu Mengist\r\nAddis Ababa, Ethiopia\r\nPhone: 912338576\r\nEmail: bmb71161@gmail.com','uploads/cv/cv-1781095790381-685589063.pdf','2026-06-10 12:49:50'),(216,0,'Birhanu Mengist Birhane','bbm8576@mail.com','Ethiopia','Addis Ababa','+251711615141','31-40','Male','Bachelor\'s Degree','5-10','[\"Sales Director\", \"Communication skill, team building and problem skill\"]','[\"English &Amharic\"]','Hybrid','2 weeks','LinkedIn',NULL,'Date: June 10, 2026\r\nTo: Hiring Manager\r\nPTGR Company\r\nAddis Ababa, Ethiopia\r\n\r\nSubject: Application for Marketing Manager Position\r\nDear Hiring Manager,\r\nI am writing to express my strong interest in the Sales Director position at PTGR Company in Addis Ababa. With my background in customer service, business operations, communication, and team coordination, I am confident in my ability to contribute effectively to your organization’s marketing and business growth objectives.\r\nI have developed strong skills in customer relationship management, sales support, market communication, and operational coordination through my professional experience. I am highly motivated, organized, and capable of working under pressure while maintaining excellent professional standards. I also possess strong interpersonal and leadership skills that help me build productive relationships with clients, colleagues, and business partners.\r\nI am particularly interested in joining PTGR Company because of its professional reputation and commitment to business excellence. I believe my dedication, problem-solving ability, and passion for marketing and customer engagement would make me a valuable addition to your team.\r\nIn addition, I am eager to learn new systems and contribute innovative ideas that can support brand awareness, customer satisfaction, and overall company performance. I am confident that my commitment to hard work and achieving results aligns with the goals of your organization.\r\nI would welcome the opportunity to discuss my qualifications further during an interview. Thank you for considering my application. I look forward to hearing from you.\r\n\r\nSincerely,\r\nBirhanu Mengist\r\nAddis Ababa, Ethiopia\r\nPhone: 912338576\r\nEmail: bmb71161@gmail.com','uploads/cv/cv-1781096254424-73162974.pdf','2026-06-10 12:57:34');
